<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id">2 Lalte</book>
  <para style="h">2 Lalte</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Lalte</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Lalte</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Lalte</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel lal Ahaba a thih hnuin Moab-ho chu Israel lakah an hel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal Ahazia chu Samaria khuaa a in chung zâwl aṭangin a tla a, a na hle a, a dam dâwn leh dâwn loh thu-ah Filistia-a Ekron khaw pathian Baal-zebuba râwn tûrin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa Vântirhkoh chuan Tisbe mi Elija chu, “Tho la, Samaria lal mi tirhte tâwk tûrin kal rawh. Israel ramah Pathian a awm lo vem ni? Engtizia nge Ekron pathian Baal-zebuba râwn tûra in kal le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, ‘I kaina khum aṭang khân i lo chhuk leh tawh lo vang, i thi ngei dâwn,’ a ti,” ti tûrin a tîr a. Elija chu a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal mi tirhte chu a hnênah an lo haw leh vat a; an hnênah, “Engtizia nge in lo kîr leh mai?” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Mi pakhatin min rawn tâwk a, ‘A tîrtu che u lal hnênah chuan kîr leh ula, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Israel ramah Pathian a awm lo vem ni? Ekron pathian Baal-zebuba râwn tûra mi i tirh le? I kaina khum ata kha i lo chhuk leh tawh lo vang, i thi ngei ang, tiin hrilh rawh u,’ min ti,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Hêng thu sawia rawn tâwktu che u chu eng ang mi nge maw a nih le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Pa hmulphurh chhe tak a ni; savun kâwnghrên a hrêng,” an ti a. Ani chuan, “Tisbe mi Elija a nih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal chuan sipai hotu, a sipai sawmnga nên a tîr a. Ani chuan tlâng chhîpa Elija lo ṭhu chu a va hmu a, a hnênah, “Nang Pathian mi, lalin, ‘Lo chhuk rawh,’ a ti a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Elija chuan, “Pathian mi ka nih tak zet chuan vân ata mei lo tla sela, nang leh i hote kha rawn kâng hlum che u rawh se,” a ti a. Vân aṭang chuan mei a lo tla a, sipaite chu an hotu nên chuan an kâng hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lal chuan sipai dang sawmnga leh an hotu a tîr leh a. Ani chu a chho va, Elija hnênah, “Nang Pathian mi, lal chuan lo chhuk thuai tûrin a ti a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elija chuan, “Pathian mi ka nih tak zet chuan vân ata mei lo tla sela, nang leh i hote kha kâng hlum che u rawh se,” a ti a. Pathian mei chu a lo tla ta nghâl a, sipai hotu chu a hote nên chuan an kâng hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal chuan sipai sawmnga dang, an hotu nên a tîr leh a. Tlângah chuan a han chho va, Elija hmaah chuan a ṭhingṭhi a, “Aw Pathian mi, kei leh ka hote hi min khawngaih la, kan nunna hi min zuahsak teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sipai hotu pahnih lah an hote nên vân aṭanga lo tla meiah an kâng hlum a, keini hi chu khawngaih takin min zuah teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa vântirhkoh chuan Elija hnênah, “A rualin chhuk rawh, hlau suh,” a rawn ti a. Tichuan, a tho va, a rual chuan a chhuk a, lal hmu tûr chuan a kal ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lal hnênah chuan, “Ekron pathian Baal-zebuba râwn tûrin mi i tîr vei maw? Israel ramah râwn tûr Pathian a awm lo vem ni? I kaina khum ata kha i lo chhuk leh tawh lo vang, i thi ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Elija sawi Lalpa thu ang chuan Ahazia chu a thi ta a. Ahazia chuan fapa a nei lo va, Judai ram lal Jehosafata fapa Jehorama a lal kum hnih kum chuan a nau Jorama chu a aiah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lal Ahazia thiltih dang zawng chu Israel lalte chanchin ziakna buah a chuang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Elija chu ṭhâwngaleivira vâna a lâk chhoh hun a lo thleng ta a. Elija leh Elisa chu Gilgal aṭang chuan an kal chhuak a, kawnga an kal lai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hetah hian lo awm teh, Lalpa chuan Bethel-a kal tûrin min tîr e,” Elija chuan a ti a. Elisa erawh chuan, “Pathian nung leh i nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, ka awmsan tawp lo vang che,” a ti a. Bethel-ah chuan an kal dûn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chumi laia zâwlnei rual awmte chu Elisa hnênah an lo kal a, “Vawiin hian i pu hi Lalpa chuan a la dâwn tih i hria em?” an ti a. Ani chuan, “Hria e, ngawi mai teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Elija chuan Elisa hnênah, “Hetah hian lo awm rawh, Lalpa chuan Jeriko-a kal tûrin min ti e,” a ti a. Elisa erawh chuan, “Pathian nung leh i nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, ka awmsan tawp lo vang che,” a ti a. Tichuan, Jeriko-ah chuan an kal dûn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuta zâwlnei rual awmte chu Elisa hnênah an lo kal a, “Vawiin hian Lalpa chuan i pu hi a lâksak dâwn che tih i hria em?” an ti a. Ani chuan, “Hria e, ngawi mai teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Elija chuan Elisa hnênah, “Hetah hian lo awm rawh, Lalpa chuan Jordan luia kal tûrin min ti e,” a ti a. Elisa erawh chuan a chhâng a, “Pathian nung leh i nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, ka awmsan tawp lo vang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An kal dûn ta zêl a, zâwlnei sawmnga chuan an zui a, hla fe aṭangin an thlîr a. Jordan lui kamah chuan an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Elija chuan a puan a hlîp a, a têl a, lui tui chu a vua a, a inṭhen phak a, leichârah an kal kai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lui an kal kai hnu chuan Elija chuan Elisa hnênah, “I hnên ata lâk ka nih hmain eng nge tihsak che ila i duh?” a ti a. Elisa chuan, “I thlarau chan leh hnih dawng ila ka duh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Elija chuan, “Thil harsa tak i ngên a ni; amaherawhchu, min lâk lai i hmuh chuan i chang ngei ang, i hmuh loh erawh chuan i chang lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An kal paha an titi dun lai chuan mei-sakawr, mei-tawlailîr hnûk an lo kal thut a, an rawn su ṭhen a. Elija chu ṭhâwngaleivirah vânah a la chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elisa chuan a hmu a, “Ka pa, ka pa, Israel-te chhantu ropui, i kal ta maw?” a ti a. A hmu ta lo va, a puan sin lai chu a phelh a, phel hnihah a pawtthlêr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A chunga Elija puan lo tla chu a la a, a kîr leh ta a. Jordan lui kamah chuan a ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a chunga Elija puan lo tla chu a la a, tui chu a vua a, “Khaw nge Elija Pathian Lalpa chu?” a ti a; tui a han vuak chuan tui chu a inṭhen a, Elisa chuan râl lehlam chu a kai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jeriko-a zâwlnei awm sawmngate khân an hmuhin, “Elija thlarau dawn kha Elisa chungah a fu ta a nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amah tâwk tûrin an kal a, a hmaah leiah an bawkkhup a, “Ngai teh, hei mi chak tak tak sawmnga kan awm a, I pu chu Lalpa thlarau chuan a la a, khawi lai tlângah emaw, ruamah emaw a hnutchhiah ta mai te hi a ni ang e, khawngaih takin kan va zawng ang e,” an ti a. Elisa chuan a chhâng a, “Kal duh suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tân zahthlâk khawpa an nawr takah chuan, “Kal ta che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, mi sawmnga chuan ni thum an zawng a, an hmu lo va. Jeriko-a Elisa a la awm lai chuan an lo haw a, “Kal duh suh u ka tih rêng kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jeriko khaw mi ṭhenkhat chu Elisa hnênah an lo kal a, “Kan khua hi i hmuh angin khaw nuam tak a ni a; amaherawhchu, tui hi a ṭhat loh avângin nau an chhiat zêl mai,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Berhbu tharah chi dah ula, han la teh u,” a ti a. An rawn lâksak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuikhurahte chuan a kal a, chi chu a phul a, “ Lalpa chuan tui chu a titui ta, tu man an thih phah tawh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tûn thlengin Elisa sawi ang chuan tuite chu a tui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan Bethel khuaah a chho va; kawnga a chhoh lai chuan khua aṭangin naupang an lo kal a, nuihza siam nân an lo hmang a, “Lu kawlh, lu kawlh, tlân bo rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A han lehhawi a, anni chu a hmu a, Lalpa hmingin ânchhia a lawh a. Ngâw aṭangin savawm pui hnih an lo chhuak a, an zînga naupang sawmli leh pahnih chu an seh hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan Samaria khuaah a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judai rama Jehosafata kum sâwm leh pariat a lal kum khân, Ahaba fapa Jehorama chu Israel ramah a lal ṭan a. Samaria khuaah kum sâwm leh pahnih a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa hmuhah thil sual a ti a, a nu Jezebeli leh a pa ang êm zawngin a sual lo. A pa milem, Baal biakna hmuna a dahte chu a tichhia a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />mahse, a hmaa lal Nebata fapa Jeroboama thil sual tihte chu a bânsan duh lo, Israel-te chu a hruai sual a, a sim duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab lal Mesa chuan berâm a vulh a, kum tin Israel lal hnênah chhiah angin berâmno nuaikhat leh berâmchal nuaikhat hmul a pe ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel lal Ahaba a thih khân Moab lal chu Israel lakah a hel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lal Jehorama chu Samaria khua aṭang chuan a chhuak vat a, a sipaite chu a khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Juda lal Jehosafata hnênah, “Kan lakah Moab lal a hel ta a, min beihpui thei ang em?” tiin thu a thawn a. Lal Jehosafata chuan, “Ka rawn pui ang che; ka mite leh i mite chu pumkhat kan ni alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khawi lam kawng aṭangin nge ka rawn beih ang?” a ti a. Jehorama chuan, “A hla lam Edom thlalêr aṭangin ka rawn bei ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal Jehorama te, Juda lal leh Edom lalte chu an thawk chhuak a, ni sarih an kal hnuin tui an tlachham ta a. Mihring in tûr pawh, an puakphur ran in tûr pawh a awm hiau tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jehorama chuan, “ Lalpa , kan Pathian hian Moab lal duh duha tih tûrin min hruai khâwm a lo nih hi, a va pawi êm!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lal Jehosafata chuan, “ Lalpa min râwnsak thei tûr zâwlnei an awm em?” a ti a. Jehorama sipai hotu pakhat chuan, “Safata fapa Elisa he laiah hian a awm, zâwlnei Elija hnungzui ṭhîntu kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lal Jehosafata chuan, “Zâwlnei dik tak a nih chu,” a ti a. Lal pathum chu zâwlnei Elisa hnênah chuan an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elisa chuan Israel lal hnênah, “Engah nge ka ṭanpui ang che, i nu leh pate biakrâwn zâwlneite kha va râwn la a ni mai alâwm,” a lo ti a. Jehorama chuan, “Amah, Lalpa hi alâwm he lai lal pathum hi Moab lal kuta min dahtu chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Elisa chuan, “A rawng ka bâwl, mi nung Lalpa chhâlin, Judai ram lal Jehosafata hi pawisa lo ila chu, kawng eng mahin ka pui lo vang che, ka lo ti asin le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Elisa chuan, “Ṭingṭang tum thiam han tîr teh u,” a ti a. Ṭingṭang tum thiamin ṭingṭang a han tum chuan, Lalpa kut chuan Elisa chu a rawn khawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ ‘Hemi ruamah hian khur lai chuk rawh u,’ Lalpa chuan a ti e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Thli tleh lovin chhûm hmu lo mah ula, ruam chu tuiin a khat dâwn; chu chu in rante leh in sate nên in in dâwn nia,’ a ti e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutiang lek chu Lalpa tân tih harsa tham a ni lo, in kutah Moab-ho pawh a pe dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kulh nei khua leh khaw nuam deuh deuh tawh phawt chu in tichhia ang a, thing ṭha deuh deuhte chu in kit ang a, tuikhur zawng zawng in hnawh ang a, lo ṭha laiah lung in dah thluah dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tûk zîng hâlral thilhlan an hlan ṭhin hun lai chuan Edom ram lam aṭangin tui a lo luang a, ruamah chuan tui a khat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Moab-ho chuan anmahni bei tûr lal pathumte chu an lo kal tih an hriat chuan mipa râlkai chin tawh phawt chu, naupang ber pawh, upa ber pawh an pung khâwm a, an ramri an lo vêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A tûk zîng khua a lo vâra, ni a lo chhuah chuan tui chu a rawn chhun sen phût a, thisen ang maia senin a lang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Thisen a nih khu, sipai pâwl thumho an inbei ang a, an inthat a ni ngei ang. Ti rawh u, an bûk i zu suam ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hmêlma bûk an zu thlenin Israel-te chuan an lo bei a, an ûm kîr a, Israel-ho chuan an ûm zêl a, Moab-ho chu an that ṭeuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An khuate chu an tihchhiatsak a, an lo ṭha laiah te chuan Israel-ho veivâk chuan lung an paih zêl a, an lote chu lunghmun a ni ta ngawt a. Tuikhurte chu an hnawh a, thei kûngte an kit a, a tâwpah chuan khawpui ber ‘Kir-hareset’ chauh a la chhe lo va, chu pawh chu virvawma beituten an hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Moab lal chuan hmêlmate chu a hneh dâwn lo tih a hriat chuan khandaih keng sipai zasarih nên hmêlma rual chu sut tlanga, Suria lalrama tlân a tum a; mahse, a thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, a fapa upa ber, a aiawhtu tûr chu a man a, Moab-ho pathian hnênah kulh bang bulah chuan a talh a, a hlân a. Israel miten an hmuh chuan an hlau hle a, khua chu an kalsan a, an ram lamah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zâwlnei pâwl khat zînga mi pakhat nupui chu zâwlnei Elisa hnênah a lo kal a; “Ka pu, i chhiahhlawh, ka pasal chu a thi a, i hriat angin Pathian ṭih mi tak a ni a. A leibatna pain a fapa pahnih bawih atân ka pasal leiba aia lâk tumin a lo thawk e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Elisa chuan, “Eng nge ka tihsak ang che le! Inah neih i nei em?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Eng mah ka nei lo, Oliv hriak bûr tê tak tê pakhat chauh a ni ka neih,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Elisa chuan, “Haw ta la, i ṭhenawmte bûr va hawh tawh, i hawh theih zât hawh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I fate nên inkhârkhum ula, bûrah chuan hriak chu ruak zêl ula, a khah veleh dah sawn zêl ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A haw ta a, a fate nên kawng an inkhârkhum a, bûr chu a fate chuan an rawn la a, ani chuan a lo thun khat zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An bûr hawh a thun khah hnu chuan, “Bûr dang han la zêl rawh u,” a ti a. Anni chuan, “Bûr a awm tawh lo,” an ti a. Hriak pawh chu a kang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian mi chu a va hrilh a, ani chuan, “Kal la, hriak chu va hralh rawh, in leiba chu rûl ula, a bâng chu i fate nên ei ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni khat chu Sunam khuaah Elisa chu a kal a; chu khuaah chuan nu hausa tak pakhat hi a awm a. Elisa chu chaw eiah a sâwm a. Chumi hnu chuan Sunam khuaa a kal apiangin a hnênah chaw a lam ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A pasal hnênah, “Heta min rawn pal fotu hi Pathian mi thianghlim tak a ni phawt ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ti teh, in chungah a riahna tûr pindan siamsak ila, khum te, dawhkân te, ṭhutthlêng te dah ila, mi a rawn tlawh apiangin a awm ṭhîn dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni khat chu Elisa a lo kal leh a, pindanah chuan a mu hahdam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sunam hmeichhia chu ko tûrin a hnungzui Gehazia chu a tîr a, hmeichhia chu a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elisa chuan Gehazia hnênah, “He nu hian min duat hle mai a, eng nge kan tihsak ve ang le? Lal emaw, sipai hotu emaw biaksak a duh em zâwt teh,” a ti a. Chu nu chuan, “Mahni chipuite zînga awm ka ni alâwm, mamawh ka nei lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Elisa chuan Gehazia hnênah, “Eng nge ka tihsak tak ang?” a ti a. Ani chuan a chhâng a, “Fapa a nei lo asin, a pasal lah a tar hle tawh si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Elisa chuan, “Hetah hian lo kal teh se,” a ti a. A lo kal a. Kawngkaah chuan a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Elisa chuan a hnênah, “Nakkum hetih hunah hi chuan fapa i pawm tawh ang,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Khai, Pathian mi i ni a, dâwt min hrilh teh suh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Elisa sawi ang chuan nau a pai a, a kum leh chutih hun lai vêl chuan fapa a hring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naupang chu a lo ṭhang lian a, tûk khat chu a pa hnênah buhsengtute nên buh an sengnaah a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A pa hnênah chuan, “Ka lu, ka lu,” a ti ta chûl a. A chhiahhlawh hnênah chuan, “A nu hnênah paw haw rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chhiahhlawh chuan a nu hnênah a paw haw ta a. Chhûn lai thlengin a nu chuan a chawi a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Elisa pindanah a luhpui a, a khumah chuan a mut a; a chhuak a, kawng chu a khâr hnan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A pasal chu a ko va, “Chhiahhlawh pakhat leh sabengtung pakhat han tîr teh, Pathian mi hnênah ka va kal ang a, ka lo kîr leh mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Thla thar kût emaw, sabat ni emaw a ni si lo va, eng atân nge vawiin ber khera a hnêna kal i duh le?” a ti a. “Kal a ṭûl a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sabengtung chu an buatsaih fel hnu chuan chhiahhlawh hnênah, “A chak thei ang berin sabengtung hi khalh ang che; ka hrilh loh che chuan muang hauh suh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Elisa awmna Karmel tlâng lam pan chuan an chhuak ta a. Hla fea a la awm lai chuan Elisa chuan a lo hmu a, a hnungzui Gehazia hnênah, “En teh, Sunam-nu kha a lo kal e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A pasal te, a fate an za-in an dam emaw lo zâwt tûrin va hmuak vat rawh,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Kan dam e,” tiin a lo chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tlânga Pathian mi hnên a lo thlen chuan a ke chu a vuan ta tlat a, Gehazia chuan rawn nam kian a tum a; mahse, Pathian mi chuan, “Eng mah tih suh, a rilru a na hle a nih hi, Lalpa lah chuan ka lakah a la thup a, min la hrilh si lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan, “Ka pu, fapa ka dîl che em ni kha? ‘Min tihder suh’ ka ti che a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Gehazia hnênah chuan, “In siam la, ka tiang hi kengin kal rawh. Mi i tawh rêng rêng chibai bûk suh la, chibai an bûk che pawhin chhâng hek suh. Ka tiang hi naupang hmaiah va kham rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Naupang nu chuan, “ Lalpa , mi nung leh i nunna chhâlin ka sawi e; i tel lo chuan ka haw hauh lo vang,” a ti a. Tichuan, a tho va, hmeichhia chu a zui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gehazia chu an hmaah a kal a, naupang hmaiah tiang chu a han kham a; mahse, thâwm rêng a nei lo va, a ngawi reng mai a. Elisa tâwk tûrin a lo kîr leh a, “Naupang chu a tho hauh lo mai,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Elisa chu inah a lo thleng a, naupang chu a thi a, a khumah khân an lo mut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A lût a, an pahnih chauh chuan a inkhârkhum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khumah chuan a lâwn a, naupang chu a bawh a, a hmui leh a hmui, a mit leh a mit, a kut leh a kut a chuktuah a; chutia a bawh lai chuan naupang pang chu a lo lum leh ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khum ata a lo chhuk a, chhuatah vawi hnih khat a vei hnuin a lâwn leh a, naupang chungah chuan a bawk leh a, naupang chu vawi sarih a hahchhiau dawt dawt a, a lo nung ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Gehazia chu a ko va, “Sunam-nu kha han ko teh,” a ti a. A han ko va, a lo kal chuan, “I fapa hi, kha, pawm rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pindan chhûngah chuan a lût a, a ke bulah chuan a bawkkhup a, a fapa chu a pawm chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ṭum khat, ram puma ṭâm a tlâk laiin Elisa chu Gilgal-ah a haw a; zâwlnei rual a zirtîr a; a chhiahhlawh hnênah chuan, “Bêl lian kha la la, zâwlnei zirho hi sawhchiar siamsak teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />An zînga pakhat chu thil thlâk tûr zawngin ramah a kal a, ram hruizâm a hmu a, a rah chu a theih tâwk a rawn pawm hâwng a; an chan a, eng tih an hre si lo va, sawhchiarah chuan an thlâk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ei tûr an suak chhuak a, an han ei dâwn chuan, “E heu, Pathian mi, bêlah hian tûr a awm a ni,” an ti a, an ei thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Chhangphut han la teh u,” a ti a. Bêlah chuan a phul a, mite hnênah chuan, “Suak ula, a ei theih tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Baal-salisa aṭangin mi pakhat a lo kal a, Pathian mi chu barli thar chhang tlang sawmhnih leh buh vui a rawn kensak a. “Hêng mite hi eitîr rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A chhiahhlawh chuan, “Eng â ni? Hei hi patling za zet ka hlui ang maw?” a ti a. Ani erawh chuan, “Hlui rawh, ei rawh se, Lalpa chuan ‘Ei sela, an ei sêng lo vang,’ a ti e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tichuan, a han hlui a, an ei a, Lalpa thu ang chuan an ei sêng ta lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Suria sipai hotu ber Naamana chu Lalpa chuan Suria hmêlma hnehsaktua a hman ṭhin avângin lal chuan a ngaisâng a, a duhsak hle bawk a. Mi chak, mi huaisen ni mah se phâr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Suria sipaite chu a pâwl pâwlin an rammu ṭhîn a, Israel ram aṭangin hmeichhe naupang tê hi an man a. Naamana nupuiin chhiahhlawhah a chhawr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pi hnênah chuan, “Ka pu hi Samaria khuaa zâwlnei hnênah va kal se ka va ti êm, a phâr hi a dam ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Naamanan chu chu a hriat chuan a pu lal hnênah a kal a, “Israel rama hmeichhe naupang chuan chutiang chuan zu sawi a le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Suria lal chuan, “Va kal ta che, Israel lal hnêna pêk tûr lehkha ka kentîr ang che,” a ti a. A kal ta a, tangka tlang sîngthum, rangkachak tlang sângruk leh puan zai sîn sin sâwm a keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel lal hnênah lehkha chu a pe a, hetianga ziak a ni: “He lehkha kengtu, ka chhiahhlawh Naamana hi a phâr a, i tihdam tûrin ka rawn tîr a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel lalin lehkha a han chhiar chuan a puan a pawtthlêr a, “Mi thata tidam thei Pathian em ka niha, he mi hian phâr tidam tûra mi rawn tih hi? Min beihna remchâng chhuanlam a zawng a ni phawt mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal mangangin a puan a pawtthlêr hial tih Pathian mi Elisa chuan a lo hriatin lal hnênah chuan mi a tîr a, “Engati nge i puan i pawhthlêr le? Ka hnênah lo kal sela, Israel ramah zâwlnei a awm tih a hre mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Naamana chu a sakawr leh a sakawr-tawlailîr nên chuan Elisa hnênah a lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Elisa chuan mi a tîr a, “Kal la, Jordan luiah vawi sarih va inbual ang che, i vun chuan a ngai a awh leh ang a, i thianghlim tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Naamana erawh chu thinur deuhvin a kal tau ta a, “A lo chhuak ang a, ka hmaa dingin a Pathian, Lalpa hming a lam ang a, a na lai chungah a kut han dahin a tidam dâwn emaw tih nâk alai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Damaska bula Abana leh Pharpar lui tui kha Israel lui tui ai chuan a thianghlim zâwk a ni lâwm ni? Chûngah chuan inbualin ka thianghlim thei tho dâwn lâwm ni?” a ti a. A lehhawi a, thinrim deuhvin a haw dâwn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A chhiahhlawh te chu a hnênah an lo kal a, “Ka pu, zâwlnei khân thil khirh tak tih tûr tuk che sela i ti dâwn lâwm ni? ‘Va inbual la, i thianghlim ang,’ a tih chuan tih mai tûr a ni lâwm ni?” an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zâwlnei sawi ang chuan Naamana chu Jordan luiah a chhuk a, vawi sarih a inhnim a, a vun chu naupang vun ang a lo ni leh a, a thianghlim ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hote zawng zawng nên Pathian mi hnênah a lo kîr a, a hmaah chuan a ding a, “Israel ramah lo chuan ram dangah Pathian a awm lo tih ka hre ta, en teh, i chhiahhlawhin thil a pêk che hi khawngaih takin la teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ani chuan, “A hmaa ka awmna ṭhin mi nung, Lalpa chhâlin ka sawi e, ka la tawp lo vang,” a ti a. La hrâm tûrin a ngên a, mahse, a duh lo tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Naamana chuan, “I lâk duh si loh chuan i chhiahhlawh hi sabengtung phur hnih lei min pe rawh; i chhiahhlawh hian Lalpa hnênah lo chuan eng pathian dang hnênah mah hâlral thilhlan ka hlân dâwn tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Suria pathian Rimona be tûra ka pu a kalin a hnung ka zui a ṭûl ṭhîn a; chutianga Rimona tempula ka kala, ka ṭhingṭhit ve pawhin Lalpa chuan min ngaidam a ni ang chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Thlamuang takin kal rawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thui a kal hmain Pathian mi Elisa hnungzui Gehazia chuan, ‘Ka pu hian Naamana chu eng mah sêng lovin a kaltîr tâk mai hi: kha Suria pain pêk a tum kha la se a ṭha tûr. Khawi nge, Lalpa mi nung chhâlin ka sawi e, ka ûm ang a, eng emaw tal chu ka lâksak teh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, Naamana chu Gehazia chuan a ûmzui ta a. Naamanan mi pakhat rawn ûmtu a hmuh chuan lo hmuak tûrin a tawlailîr aṭang chuan a lo chhuk a, a hnênah, “A ṭha lam em ni?” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ṭha lam ni e, ka pu chuan, ‘Efraim tlângram aṭangin zâwlnei pahnih an lo kal a, tangka tlang sângthum leh puan sin hnih i pe thei lâwm ni?’ a ti a che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Naamana chuan, “Tangka sângruk tal hi la teh,” a ti a. La tûrin a nawr chiam a, tangka chu ip hnihah a khung a, puan sin hnih nên a chhiahhlawhte a phurhtîr a, an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tlângchhîp a lo thlen chuan an kut ata chu a la a, in chhûngah a dah ṭha a, mite chu a tîr haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ani chu inah a lût a, a pu hmaah chuan a va ding a, Elisa chuan, “Gehazi, khawi aṭanga lo kal nge i nih?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Khawiah mah ka kal hlei nêm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Mi, nangmah hmuak tûra a tawlailîr ata a lo chhuk lai khân ka thlarau chu i hnênah a awm lo vem ni? Tangka leh puan kha i la a ni lâwm ni? Grep huan te, berâm leh bâwng te, chhiahhlawh mipa leh hmeichhiate pawh lei ta mai che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Naamana phâr hi nang leh i thlahten in kai hlen ang,” a ti a. A pu hma ata chu a chhuak a, vûr angin a vun a phâr vâr ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zâwlnei zirho chuan Elisa hnênah, “I hova kan khawsakna in hi a chêp hle si a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jordan lui kamah zuk kal ila, thing kan la ang a, kan awmhona tûr in kan zu sa ang e,” an ti a. “Kal ta che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An zînga pakhat chuan, “Khawngaih takin lo kal ve ta che,” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Kal ve e maw le,” a ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />an rual chuan a kal ve ta a. Jordan lui an zu thlen chuan thing chu an kit ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi pakhatin thing a kih lai chuan a hrei chu a thlawn a, tuiah a tla ta a; “Ka pu, a va pawi em! Mi ta kan hawh a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian mi chuan, “Khawiah tak nge a tlâk?” a ti a, a tlâkna lai chu a kawhhmuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thingṭang a tan a, a khawh lût a, hreifang chu a tilâng ta a, “La rawh le,” a ti a, a han ban a, a la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Suria lal chuan Israel lal a rûn dâwn a, khawi khawia chân rûk nge ṭha ang tih a hote nên an sawi tlâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian mi Elisa chuan Israel lal hnênah, “Hêngah te hian kal suh, Suria lal hovin an châng ru dâwn che a ni,” tiin a hrilh zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel lal chuan Pathian miin a sawi hmuna awmte chu a hrilh a, an inrâlring hman zêl a ni; chutiang chuan vawi tam tak an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Suria lal chu a mangang ta a, a hote chu a ko va, “Israel lal lamṭang ru kan zîngah tu hi nge min hrilh teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hotu zînga pakhat chuan, “Kan zîngah chutiang pakhat mah kan awm lo, aw lalber, Israel zînga zâwlnei Elisan i pindan chhûngrila i thu sawi chen khân Israel lal a hrilh ṭhîn alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Khaw nge a awm va zawng teh u, mi ka tîr ang a, va man teh se,” a ti a. “Dothan khuaah a awm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, sakawr te, tawlailîr te, sipai tam tak nên a tîr ṭeuh va, khua chu zânah an va hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian mi chhiahhlawh tlangvâl chu zîngah a tho va, a va chhuah chuan sipai tam takin sakawr leh tawlailîrte nên khua an hual chu a va hmu a, a pu hnênah chuan, “Ka pu, a va pawi em! Engtin nge kan tih tâk ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Thlaphâng suh, kan lamṭang chu an lamṭang aiin an tam zâwk asin,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Elisa chu a ṭawngṭai a, “Aw Lalpa , a mit hi han tihmensak teh,” a ti a. Lalpa chuan tlangvâl mit chu a tihmensak a, a hmu ve ta a, Elisa awmna chhak tlâng khatin mei-sakawr leh mei-tawlailîr a lo awm khup mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Elisa hualtute a hnêna an lo chhuk chuan Elisa chu Lalpa hnênah a ṭawngṭai a, “An mit tihdelsak teh,” a ti a. Elisa thu ang chuan an mit chu a tihdelsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Elisa chuan an hnênah, “Hei hi kawng a ni lo ve, in mi zawn awmna khua lah a ni hek lo, a awmnaah ka hruai ang che u,” a ti a. Samaria khuaah a hruai lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Samaria khua an va thleng a, Elisa chuan, “Aw Lalpa , hêng mite mit hi tihmensak teh, hmu teh se,” a ti a. Lalpa chuan an mit a tihmensak a, an hmu thei ta a. An han hawivêl chuan Samaria khaw chhûngah an lo awm reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel lal chuan Elisa hnênah, “Kan that mai dâwn lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “That lo ve, khandaih leh thala inbeiha in mi mante mah in that hlei nêm. Ei tûr chaw leh tui pe la, eiin in sela, an pu hnênah haw rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chaw tam tak a chhumsak a, an eia an in kham hnu chuan a chhuah a, an pu hnênah an kal ta a. Suria lal sipaite chuan Israel ram chu an rawn rûn leh tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chumi hnu fê chuan Suria lal Ben-hadada chuan sipai a khâwm a, Samaria khuaah a chho va, a hual ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An hual rei avângin Samaria khua chu an ṭâm ta hle a, sabengtung lu hi tangka tlang sawmriatin an hralh a, ṭhuro êk gram zahnih tangka tlang nga man a ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel lal chu kulh bang fangin a kal a, nu pakhat hian, “Min pui teh, aw lalber, ka Lalpa ,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan a puih ngawt loh che chuan hruiha buh emaw, khura hriak emaw eng mah ka nei tawh bîk hlei nêm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Eng i ti nge?” a ti leh a. Ani chuan, “He hmeichhia hian, ‘I fa kha han thawh la, vawiinah kan ei ang a, naktûkah ka fa kan ei dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka fa chu kan chhûm a, kan ei ta a. A tûkah chuan, ‘I fa chu han la la, kan ei dâwn nia,’ ka ti a; mahse, a fa chu a thukru ta daih si,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lalin chu thu chu a han hriatin a puan a pawtthlêr a; kulh bang a fang a ni a, mipuiin an han en chuan a puan hnuaiah saiip puan a lo sin reng mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Vawiin ni a tlâk hmain Safata fapa Elisa lu hi ka lâka ka lâk loh hrim chuan Lalpa chuan a duh duhin, na tak pawhin min sawisa rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Elisa chu a inah a ṭhu a, upaho pawh an ṭhu ve a. Lal chuan mi a tîr a, chu mi lo thlen hma chuan Elisa chuan upaho hnênah, “Ngai teh u, he tual thah chîngpa hian ka lu lâk tumin mi a rawn tîr a nih hi. A mi tirh chu kawngkhâr hnan ula, lo dang tlat ang che u. Chu! A rawn zuitu thâwm chu a pu, lal kal thâwm a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A la ṭawng lai chuan lal chu a lo thleng ve ta nghâl mai a: “Heti khawpa mi timangangtu chu Lalpa hi a ni a, engah nge Lalpa thu ka la ngaih cheu vang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elisa chuan, “ Lalpa thu hi ngaithla teh; naktûk hetih hunah hian Samaria khuaah chhangphut ṭha chi kg. thum pawh, barli chhangphut kg. ruk pawh tangka tlang khatin in lei thei ang,’ a ti e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal vêngtu bîk sipai hotu chuan, Pathian mi chu a chhâng a, “ Lalpa chuan vân tukverh pawh hawngin ruah sûrtîr mah se, chutiang êm chu a thleng ngût lo vang e!” a ti a. Elisa chuan, “A hmuh zawng i hmu ang a, a ei zawng i ei ve dâwn lo a nih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Samaria khaw kulh pâwnah chuan phâr pali hi an awm a; “Eng atân nge maw thih nghâk ngawta kan ṭhut reng le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khaw chhûngah lût ila, rilṭâmin kan thi ve mai âwm si a, hetah pawh awm reng ila kan thi mai bawk dâwn si a. Ti teh u, Suria-ho bûkah i tlulût mai teh ang; a thah leh min lo that mai ang chu; min lo zuah mial mai thei asin,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thimhlimah chuan Suria-ho bûka kal tûrin an thawk chhuak ta a. Suria-ho bûk fêm an va thlen chuan tu mah an lo awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Suria-ho chu sakawr-tawlailîr tlân leh sakawr tlân ri dur dur thâwm te, sipai tam tak kal ṭhup ṭhup thâwmte a hriattîr a, “Israel lal hian Hit lal te, Aigupta lal te, min bei tûrin a pun a ni phawt mai,” an ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, khaw thim dâwnah chuan baklêngin an tlânchhia a, an bûk te, an sakawr te, an sabengtung te, an bûka an thil chhêk te chu an hnutchhiah a, an tlânsan pheng phung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Phârhovin bûk an thlen chuan bûk pakhatah an han lût a, an eiin an in a; tangka te, rangkachak te leh silhfên te chu an la a, an va thukru a, bûk dangah an lût leh a, chuta mi pawh chu an chheprelh leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An inbia a, “Kan tih dân hi a ṭha hauh lo mai. Vawiin hi ni lâwmawm a ni, kan ngawih mai maia, khawvâr kan nghah chuan hrem kan tuar ngei ang; chuvângin, chanchin ṭha hi lal chhûngte i va hrilh ang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khaw kulh kawngkhârah chuan an kal a, kawngkhâr vêngtu hnênah chuan, “Suria-ho bûkah kan va kal a, tu mah an lo awm lo, han biak tûr pawh pakhat mah an awm lo. An sakawr te, an sabengtung te chu an la thlung vek a ni, an bûk te pawh a ngai ngaiin a la ding vek,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kawngkhâr vêngtute chu lal in chhûngah an kal a, an va hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zânah lal chu a tho va, a hote hnênah chuan, “Suria-hovin min tihder an tum dân hi ka hrilh ang che u. Khua kan ṭâmzia an hria a, bûk chhuahsanin ram hnuaiah an biru a ni ngei ang, ‘khua ata an lo chhuak ang a, a nung chungin kan man ang a, khua chu kan la mai ang,’ an ti a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hote zînga mi pakhat chuan, “He khuaa mite hi kan chan a chau ta sa reng reng mai a, tam tak kan thi tawh a. Ti rawh u, sakawr panga la dam kan nei a, a chunga chuang tûr i ruat ang u, he thil hi finfiah teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi an thlang chhuak a, lal chuan sakawr-tawlailîr pahnih a pe a, Suria sipaite chanchin en fiah tûrin a tîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûng mite chu Jordan lui thlengin an kal a, Suria sipai tlânchhiain an kawr leh thawmhnaw an thlauh zel zul chu an hmu zêl a; an lo haw leh a, lal hnênah thu an rawn thlen a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Samaria mite chu khua ata an tlân chhuak a, Suria-ho bûk chu an rawk ta chiam a. Lalpa sawi ang khân chhangphut ṭha chi kg. thum pawh, barli chhangphut kg. ruk pawh tangka tlang khatin an hralh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel lal chuan amah vêng ṭhîntu sipai hotu kha kawngkhâr vêng tûrin a lo ti kher a. Elisa hmu tûra lal nên an kala, a lo sawi ang khân chu sipai hotu chu mipui chuan an chîl a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Elisa chuan, “Naktûk hetih hunah chhangphut ṭha chi kg. thum pawh, barli chhangphut kg. ruk pawh tangka tlang khat man a ni ang,” a ti a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />kha sipai hotu khân, “ Lalpa chuan vân tukverh pawh hawngin ruah sûrtîr mah se, chutiang êm chu a thleng ngût lo vang,” a ti a, Elisa chuan a chhâng a, “A hmuh zawng i hmu ang a, a ei zawng i ei ve dâwn lo a nih chu,” a ti a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutiang tak chuan thil a lo awm ta a, khaw kulh kawngkhârah chuan mipuiin an chîl a, an chîlhlum ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan kum sarih chhûng Israel ramah chuan ṭâm a tlâktîr dâwn tih Elisa chuan Sunam-nu, a fapa a tihdamsak kha a hrilh a, an chhûnga hmun danga insawn tûrin a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian mi thu chu a zâwm a, an chhûng chuan Filistia ramah an kal a, kum sarih an thang bo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum sarih a ral hnu chuan hmeichhia chu Israel ramah a lo kîr leh a, lal hnênah a in leh a ram kha pêk kîr leh a rawn dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lal leh Elisa hnungzui Gehazia chu an lo inbia a, Elisa thil mak tih lal chuan a hre duh a, a lo zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Elisan mitthi a tihnun leh thu Gehazian a hrilh lai chuan chu hmeichhia chu lal hmaah a lo kal ve chiah a. Gehazia chuan, “Ka pu, ka sawi hmeichhia kha he nu hi a ni; Pathian mi Elisan a tihnun leh pawh kha hei, a fapa hi alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalin a dik leh dik loh a han zawh ve chuan, “Dik e,” a ti a. Lal chuan a thu ngaihtuah fel tûr hotu pakhat a ruatsak a, “A neih ṭhin zawng zawng chu pe kîr la, a awm loh chhûnga a ram aṭanga thil thar zawng man chhûtin pêk tûr zât chu pe ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Suria lal Ben-hadada a dam loh laiin Elisa chu Damaska khuaah a kal kher a, “Pathian mi a lo kal e,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal chuan Hazaela hnênah, “Thilpêk tûr eng emaw keng la, Pathian mi chu va hmu teh, ka dam chhuak dâwn nge dâwn lo, Lalpa min râwnsak teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, Hazaela chu amah hmu tûrin a kal ta a. Damaska khuaa thil ṭha ṭha, thilpêk a keng ṭeuh va, sanghâwngsei phur sawmli lai a keng a ni. A lo kal a, a hmaah chuan a ding a, “I fapa, Suria lal, Ben-hadada chuan i hnênah min tîr a ni. ‘Ka nâ hi ka dam leh ang em?’ a ti e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Elisa chuan a hnênah, “Kal ta la, a dam leh ngei ang tih hrilh rawh. Amaherawhchu, Lalpa chuan a thi ngei dâwn tih min hmuhtîr e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hazaela chu zahthlâk khawpin a melh ta rûn a, Pathian mi chu a ṭap ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hazaela chuan, “Ka pu, engtizia nge i ṭah tâk le?” a ti a. Ani chuan, a chhâng a, “Israel mite chunga thil ṭha lo i tih tûr ka hmu a ni, an kulh te i hâlsak dâwn a, an tlangvâlte khandaihin i sât hlum ang a, an nausênte leichârah i vaw hlum ang a, an hmeichhia, nau pai laite chu an dul i pir ṭehsak dâwn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hazaela chuan, “Kei, i chhiahhlawh uicho mai hi chutiang ti tûr em ka nih?” a ti a. Elisa chuan a chhâng a, “ Lalpa chuan Suria lala i ṭang min hmuhtîr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Elisa chu a chhuahsan a, a pu hnênah chuan a kal ta a. Ani chuan, “Elisa chuan eng nge a lo hrilh che?” a ti a. “I dam leh ngei dâwn thu min lo hrilh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Hazaela chuan puan a la a, tuiah a chiah a, lal chu a hup hlum ta a. Hazaela chu Ben-hadada aiah Suria ram lal a lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel lal Ahaba fapa Jorama lal kum nga kum chuan Jehosafata fapa Jehorama chu Judai ram lal a lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum sawmthum leh pahnih a nihin a lal ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum riat a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A nupui chu Ahaba fanu a ni. Ahaba chhûng dangte ang bawkin Israel lalte awm dân ṭha lo chu a la a. Lalpa hmuha thil sual a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Juda-te chu tihboral vek a hreh a ni, a chhiahhlawh Davida hnênah, “I thlahte chu lalah an ṭang reng ang,” tia a lo tiam tlat tawh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jehorama lal lai hian Judai ram lakah Edom-ho an hel a, mahni lal an nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jehorama chu Zair lamah a sakawr-tawlailîr nên a kal a. Edom-ho chuan an lo hual a, zânah a tawlailîr pute nên an tlân chhuak thei hrâm a, a sipaite chu an darh a, in lamah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuta chin chu Edom hi Juda-ho hnuaiah an awm lo hlen ta a. Hetih hun lai bawk hian Libna khua pawh an hel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jehorama thil tih dang zawng zawng chu Juda-te lal chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jehorama chu a thi a, Davida khawpuia lal thlânah an phûm a, a fapa Ahazia chu a aiah a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel lal Ahaba fapa Jorama lal kum sawm pahnih kumah Jehorama fapa Ahazia chu Judai ram lal a lo ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />kum sawmhnih leh pahnih a nihin a lal ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum khat a lal a. A nu chu Ahaba fanu Athali, Israel lal Omria tunu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahazia chuan Ahaba thlahte zînga mi fanu nupuia a neih avângin Ahaba chhûng dangte ang bawkin Lalpa hmuha thil sual an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lal Ahazia leh Israel lal Jorama chu Suria lal Hazaela bei tûrin an inthurual a. Gilead biala Ramot khuaah an sipaite chu an inbei a; Jorama chuan indonaah hliam a tuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Awm dam tûrin Jezreel khuaah a lo kal a, Ahazia chuan a va tlawh a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan zâwlnei Elisan zâwlnei la tlangvâl tak hi a ko va, “Insiam la, he hriak bûr hi keng la, Ramot-gilead-ah va kal rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I va thlen chuan Nimsia tupa, Jehosafata fapa Jehua zawng chhuak ang che. A awmna inah lût la, a ṭhiante zîng ata pindan chhûngrilah luhpui la.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lu-ah he oliv hriak hi i leih ang a, ‘ Lalpa chuan Israel-te lal atân hriak a thih ta a che,’ ti ang che. Kawngkhâr chu hawng la, chhuak vang vang la, muangchâng suh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zâwlnei tlangvâl chu Ramot-gilead-ah chuan a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A va thlen chuan sipai hotute chu an lo ṭhu khâwm a. “I hnênah thu sawi tûr ka nei e, sipai hotu,” a ti a. Jehua chuan, “Kan zînga tu hi nge i biak duh?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Aw sipai hotu, nang kha a ni ka biak duh chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tho va, in chhûngah chuan a lût a, a lu-ah hriak chu a leih a, “Israel-te Pathian chuan, ‘ Lalpa mi, Israel-te chunga lal tûrin hriak ka thih ta a che,’ a ti e” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“I pu Ahaba chhûngte chu i that ang a, ka chhiahhlawhte thisen leh Lalpa chhiahhlawhte thisen Jezebeli chhuahte phuba chu ka la dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahaba thlahte chu an boral vek ang a; naupang pawh, upa pawh mipa zawng zawng chu ka tiboral vek dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahaba chhûngte chu Nebata fapa Jeroboama chhûngte leh Ahija fapa Baasa chhûngte ang khân ka sawisa ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jezebeli chu Jezreel-ah ui-in a sa an ei ang; tu mah phûmtu an awm lo vang,” a ti a. Kawngka chu a hawng a, a chhuak ta vang vang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jehua chu a pu hote zîngah chuan a lo chhuak a, pakhat chuan, “A ṭha lam em ni? Mi â-pa kha engah nge i hnêna a lo kal le?” a ti a. Jehua chuan, “A duh chu in hria alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Hre suh e, han sawi teh,” an ti a. “ Lalpa chuan, ‘Israel lal atân hriak ka thih ta a che, a ti e,’ min ti alâwm,” Jehua chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A sipai hotupuite chuan an puan an hlîp sawk sawk a, kailâwn chungah Jehua din nân an phah a, tawtawrâwt an hâm a, “Jehua hi lal a ni ta,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimsia tupa, Jehosafata fapa Jehua chuan Jorama chu a phiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jorama chu Suria lal nên Ramot khuaa an inbeih lai khân an hliam a, Jezreel khuaah awm dam tûrin a kal a ni. Jehua chuan a ṭhiante hnênah, “Ka lama in ṭan phawt chuan Ramot khua aṭang hian Jezreel mite hnêna chanchin hrilh tûr tu mah chhuah suh ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A tawlailîrah chuan a chuang a, Jezreel lam a pan ta vang vang a. Jorama chu a la dam chiang lo va, Juda lal Ahazia chuan a tlawh a; tah chuan a lo awm ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jezreel in sânga râlvêngtu chuan Jehua leh a hote lo kal chu a hmu a, “Sakawr chunga chuang mi ṭhenkhat lo kal ka hmu e,” a ti a. Jorama chuan, “Hmêlma an ni nge ni lo hre tûrin sakawr chungchuang pakhat tîr teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An mi tirh chu Jehua-te hnên a va thleng a, “Lalin ṭhian ṭha anga lo kal i nih leh nih loh a hre duh e,” a ti a. Jehua chuan, “I hriat ve tûr a awm lo ve, hnung lamah khân kal rawh,” a ti a. Râlvêngtu chuan, “Mi lo kalte chu kan mi tirh chuan a va fin a, a lo kîr leh rih lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi dang an tîr leh a, ani chuan Jehua chu thu ngai bawk a zâwt leh a, Jehua chuan, “I hriat tûr a awm lo ve, hnung lamah khân kal rawh,” a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Râlvêngtu chuan an mi tirh chu, “Mi lo kalte chu kan mi tirh chuan a va fin a, a lo kîr bîk lo,” a ti a. “An hruaitu chuan a tawlailîr chu mi â ang maiin a khalh ka ti, Jehua ang maiin,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lal Jorama chuan, “Ka tawlailîr buatsaih teh u,” a ti a. An siam zawh chuan Juda lal Ahazia nên mahni tawlailîr ve vea chuangin Jehua tâwk tûr chuan an chhuak dûn a. Nabota huanah an va tâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jorama chuan, “Jehu, ṭha lam thil em ni?” a ti a. Jehua chuan, “I nu Jezebeli chîn chhuah milem biak leh dawi heti taka a hluar chhûng chu engtin nge a ṭha lam a nih theih ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jorama chuan, “Ahazia, min thah an tum a ni e,” tiin a au va, a tawlailîr chu a kai her a, a tlânchhe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jehua chuan a thalngul chu theihtâwpin a kuai a, Jorama hnung lamah a kâp a, a thal chuan a lung a fuh a, tawlailîrah chuan a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jehua chuan a hnungzuitu Bidkara hnênah, “A ruang saw Nabota huanah paih ang che. Jorama pa Ahaba hnungzuia sakawra kan chuan laia Ahaba chungthu Lalpa sawi kha hre reng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘Nabota leh a fate nimina an tualthih dân kha ka hmu ve reng a ni; hemi hmunah ngei hian ka hrem ve ang che,’ a tih kha. Jorama ruang chu la la, Nabota huan ngeiah, Lalpa sawi angin paih ang che,” tiin a hnungzuitu chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Juda lal Ahazia chuan hêng thil hi a hmuhin a tawlailîr nên Beth-hagan lamah a tlân a, Jehua chuan a ûmzui a, a hote hnênah, “A tawlailîr chuang saw that rawh u,” a ti a. Ibleam khaw bul Gur chhova a tlân lai chuan an kâp hliam a, Megido-ah a kal a; tah chuan a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A hote chuan tawlailîrin a ruang chu Jerusalem-ah an phur chho va, Davida khawpui, lal thlânah an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahaba fapa Jorama chu Israel rama kum sâwm leh pakhat a lal kumin Ahazia chu Judai ramah a lal ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jehua chuan Jezreel a lo thleng tih Jezebeli chuan a hriatin a mit ko a hnawih dum a, a sam a chei danglam a, lal insâng tukverh aṭangin a lo dâk chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kulh kawngkhâra Jehua a lo luh chuan, “Mahni pute thattu Zimri, a ṭha lam duha lo kal em i nih?” tiin a lo au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jehua chu a han dâk a, “Ka lamṭang in awm em?” a ti a. Hotu pahnih pathum tukverhah an lo dâk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jehua chuan an hnênah, “Han nam thla rawh u,” a ti a. Tichuan, Jezebeli chu an nam thla a, a thisen a per uai a, bangahte a kai a, sakawrte pawh chu a per berh a, a ruang chu an rap nawk nawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />In chhûngah Jehua chu a lût a, a eiin a in tê tê a, “Kha hmeichhe sual ruang kha phûm rawh u, lal fanu a ni khanglâng si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Phûm tûrin an va kal a, a luruh, a kut leh keruh chauh an va hmu tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jehua chu an rawn hrilh a, “ Lalpan a chhiahhlawh Tisbe mi Elija kâa a sawi, ‘Jezebeli chu Jezreel khuaah ui-in an ei ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />an ei bâng chu tu ruang nge tih hriat rual loh khawpin lei vaivutah a darh ang,’ a tih kha a lo thleng ta a nih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samaria khuaah chuan Ahaba fapa sawmsarih an awm a. Samaria khaw upate, hotute leh Ahaba fa enkawltu te hnênah Jehua chuan lehkha a thawn a, hetiang hian a ziak a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Lal fate chu in kutah an awm a, tawlailîr te, sakawr te, râlthuam te, kulh nei khua te in thu thu-a hman tûr in nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka lehkha hi in hmuh veleh lal fate zînga fel ber thlang chhuakin lalah siam ula; in lal thar tân chuan do rawh u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Samaria khaw hotute chuan an hlau êm êm a. “Lal pahnih pawhin an ngam lo va, keini tehlulin engtin nge kan ngam ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal in enkawltu te, khaw hotute, upate leh lal fa enkawltute chuan an chhâng a, “I chhiahhlawh kan ni a, tih tûr i tih apiang ti tûrin kan inpeih reng e. Tu dang mah lala siam kan tum lo, ṭha i tih ang angin ti mai rawh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jehua chuan lehkha dang a thawn leh a, “Ka lamṭang in niha, ka thu in awih dâwn chuan naktûk hetih hunah Jezreel khuaah hian lal fate lu kha han la rawh u,” tiin. Ahaba fa sawmsarihte chu Samaria khaw hotu, anmahni enkawl seiliantute kuta awm an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jehua lehkha an hmuh chuan Samaria khaw hotu te chuan Ahaba fa sawmsarihte chu an that vek a, an lu chu bâwmah an khung a, Jezreel-ah Jehua hnênah an thawn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahaba fate lu chu an rawn la ta tih Jehua chu an hrilh a. Ani chuan, “Khawpui kulh kawngka bulah hmun hnihah tiang khâwm ula, naktûk thlengin awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A tûkah kulh kawngka bulah chuan a va kal a, chu laia lo awmte hnênah chuan, “Lal Jorama phiara thattu ka ni, chu mi mawh chu nangni phurh tûr a ni lo. Hêng mite hi tu thah nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahaba fate chungchânga Lalpa thu sawi kha a thlâwn lo va ni tih hre rawh u. Lalpa chuan a zâwlnei Elija hnêna a sawi zawng zawng kha a rawn ti ta a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jezreel-ah chuan Ahaba laichîn hnai te, sipai hotu te, a ṭhian bul te leh a puithiam te chu pakhat mah zuah hlek lovin a that fai vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jehua chuan Jezreel a chhuahsan a, Samaria khuaah kal a tum a. Kawngah, ‘Berâmpu bûk,’ an tihah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Juda lal Ahazia chhûngte a tâwk a, “Tute nge in nih?” a ti a. “Ahazia laichîn kan ni, lalnu Jezebeli fate leh lal chhûngte chibai bûk tûrin Jezreel khuaah kan kal dâwn a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jehua chuan a hote hnênah, “A nung chungin man teh u,” a ti a. An man a, chumi kiang, Beth-eked khur bulah chuan a that ta a. An vaiin mi sawmli leh pahnih an ni, pakhat mah an zuah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jehua chu a kal zêl a, Rekaba fapa Jehonadaba chuan a rawn tâwk a. Jehua chuan chibai a lo bûk a, “I chunga rilru ka put ang hian ka chungah rilru ṭha i pu ve em?” a ti a. Jehonadaba chuan, “Pu e,” a ti a. “Chuti chu i kutin mi han ban teh,” Jehua chuan a ti a. Kut an insuih a, Jehua chuan tawlailîrah a kai lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ka rualin kal ve la, Lalpa tâna ṭhahnem ka ngaihzia nangmah ngeiin hmu ang che,” a ti a. Samaria khuaah tawlailîr chuan an chuang lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An va thlen chuan Ahaba laichîn zawng zawng chu pakhat mah zuah lovin a that ta phiar a. Elija hnêna Lalpa sawi kha a lo thleng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jehua chuan Samaria mite chu a ko khâwm a, an hnênah, “Lal Ahaba khân nêp takin Baal rawng a bâwl ṭhîn a, Jehua erawh chuan a uar hle dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Baal zâwlnei te, a betu zawng zawng te leh a puithiam zawng zawng ko khâwm teh u; tu mah hmaih tûr a ni lo. Baal hnênah thilhlan ropui tak ka hlân dâwn, a lo tel ve lo chu tihhlum vek tûr an ni,” a ti a. Baal betute tihhlum vek a tum avângin chutiang chuan fin vervêk a chhuah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Baala biakna tûr ni ruat rawh u,” Jehua chuan a ti a. Ni an ruat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jehua chuan Israel rama mite chu a chah khâwm a; Baal betu zawng zawng chu an lo kal a, lo kal lo rêng an awm lo. Baal tempulah chuan an ṭhu khat hmur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Puithiam kawr enkawltute hnênah, “Baal betu zawng zawng bah tûr puan han la teh,” a ti a. Puan bah tûr chu a rawn la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Jehua leh Rekaba fapa Jehonadaba chu Baal tempulah chuan an lût ve a, “Baal betu ni lo, Lalpa betu hetah hian an awm ve nge awm ve lo zawng ngun teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hâlral thilhlan leh thilhlan chi dang dang hlân tûrin Baala tempulah chuan an lût ve ta a ni. Jehua chuan mi sawmriat pâwnah a dah ru a, an hnênah, “Hêngho hi in thah vek tûra ka tih an ni; in chhuah vaih chuan a chhuahtu chu a chhuaha aiah thah ve tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hâlral thilhlan a hlan zawhin Jehua chuan a sipaite leh an hotute hnênah, “Lût ula, tu mah zuah lovin that vek rawh u,” a ti a. Baal tempulah chuan khandaih phawisa nên an lût a, an that ta vek a; an ruang chu an rawn hnûk chhuak a; Tempul chhûngrilah an lût a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />chutah Baal lim thingtum an phunte chu an la chhuak a, an hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Baal lim lung phunte chu an titliak a, Tempul chu an ṭhiat a, tûn thlengin miin inthiarna takah an hmang ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Israel ramah Baal biakna chu tihchhiat a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nebata fapa Jeroboama suahsualna, Israel-te a hruai khawlohna sual chu Jehua chuan a thlah vek lo. Bethel-ah leh Dan khuaa rangkachak bâwngno limte kha an la be ta zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Jehua hnênah, “Ka hmuha thil ṭha i tih a, ka duh angin Ahaba chhûngte i sawisak avângin i thlahte chhuan li thlengin Israel ramah an lal ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nimahsela, Jehua chuan Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian dân chu tihtakzetin a zâwm duh lo va; Jeroboama sualna, Israel-te a hruai khawlohna sual kha a thlah phal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Israel ram chu Lalpa chuan a tihzîmsak a. Suria lal Hazaela khân Israel ram a rawn rûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jordan lui chhak lam ram, Gilead te, Gad-ho te, Reuben-ho te leh Manase-ho te awmna ram Arnon luiruama Aroer te, an khawpui Gilead leh Basan thlengin a la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jehua thiltih dang zawng zawng, a chakzia te, Israel lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jehua chu a thi a, Samaria khuaah chuan an phûm ve ta a. A fapa Jehoahaza chu a aiah a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Kum sawmhnih leh pariat chhûng Samaria khuaah chuan Jehua chu a lal a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Ahazia thih thu a nu Athali chuan a hriat veleh lal chhûngte chu a thahtîr vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahazia fapa Joasa chiah a thah hmaih a. Lal Jehorama fanu Jehosebi, Ahazia farnu chuan a thukru a ni. A awmtu nên Tempul pindan pakhatah Athali hmuh loh tûrin a thukru a, thah a ni ve ta lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Athali lal chhûng kum ruk chu Jehosebi chuan tempulah a dah a, a rûkin a enkawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kum sarih kum chuan puithiam lalber Jehoiada chuan lal vêngtu Keret sipai za rual hotute leh lal in vêngtu sipai hotute chu a ko va, a thil tih tum chu a hrilh a, Tempul chhûngah chhia chhamin an remtihpui a, lal Ahazia fapa Joasa chu a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hetiang hian a hrilh a: “Sabat nia hna thawk tûra in lo kal hunah hmun thuma ṭhen hmun khat chuan lal in vêng ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chuan Sur kawngkhâr vêng ula; a dang hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chuan vêngtuho hnung kawngkhâr vêng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vêngtu pâwl hnih Sabat nia châwl tûrte chu lal vêng tûrin tempulah an awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal Joasa hi khandaih phawi sa kengin in vêng tûr a ni, a kalna apiangah zui ang che u. Rawn hnaihtu chu lo that zêl ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sipai hotute chuan Jehoiada thu chu an zâwm a, an sipai sabat nia châwl tûrte leh thawk tûrte chu an rawn hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tempul chhûnga dah ṭhat lal Davida feite leh phâwte chu sipai hotute a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tempul hma lamah khandaih phawi sa kengin lal vêng tûrin a din tlartîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jehoiada chuan Joasa chu a hruai chhuak a, lallukhum chu a khumtîr a, lal awm dân tûr ziakna dân bu chu a pe a. Joasa chu hriak an thih a, lalah an puang ta a. Mipui chuan kut an beng dur dur a, “Lal chu dam reng rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalnu Athali chuan vêngtuho sipaite leh mipui thâwm chu a hriatin mipui punkhâwmna Tempul lamah chuan hmanhmawh takin a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lal thar chu lal din ṭhinna tûra ruat Tempul luhna ban bulah chuan a lo ding a. Sipai hotute leh tawtawrâwtpute chuan an lo din hual a, mipuite chu hlim takin an au dur dur a, tawtawrâwtte an hâm a. Athali mangang chuan a puan a pawtthlêr a, “Min phiar ru a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jehoiada chuan Tempul hung chhûnga Athali thah chu a remti lo va, sipai hotute hnênah, “Sipai intlar kârah hruai chhuak ula, rawn chhan tum apiang lo that zêl ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Athali chu an man a, lal in lamah an hruai a. Sakawr kawngkhâr an tihah chuan an that ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Puithiam Jehoiada chuan lal Joasa leh mipui chu Lalpa mi ni tûrin thu a tiamtîr a. Lal leh mipui inkârah pawh thuthlung a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mipuite chu Baal tempulah an kal a, an ṭhiat a, maichâmte chu an tichim a, milimte chu an vaw sawm vek a. Baal puithiam Matana chu a maichâm bulah chuan an that a. Puithiam Jehoiada chuan Tempul vêng tûr a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal vêngtu Keret sipai za rual hotute, lal in vêngtu sipai hotute nên chuan Tempul aṭangin lal chu lal inah an hruai a, mipuiin an zui a. Vêngtu kawngkhârah Joasa chu a lût a, lalṭhutthlêngah chuan a ṭhu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mipui chu an hlim êm êm a, Athali chu lal ina an thah tâk avângin khuaah buaina eng mah a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joasa chu kum sarih mi a nihin Juda lalah a ṭang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel rama Jehua kum sarih a lal kumin Joasa chu Judai ram lalah a ṭang a, Jerusalem khuaah kum sawmli a lal a. A nu chu Beer-seba mi Zibi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puithiam Jehoiada khân a kaihhruai ṭhin avângin a dam chhûngin Lalpa lawmzâwng a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mahse, hnam dang pathian biakna hmunsângte chu a tibo lo va, chûngah chuan miten thilhlan an la hlân zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehoiada chuan puithiamte chu a ko khâwm a, Tempula thilhlan rualin miten thilpêk an rawn keng ṭhîn, a ṭhen chu thilhlan zînga pêk tel ngei tûra tihte a ni a, a ṭhen erawh chu mahni duh thu-a thilpêk a ni; chûng chu dah ṭha zêl tûrin a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An rawng an bâwlsakten chutianga pawisa an rawn ken chu rawngbâwltu puithiam chuan a lo dawng ang a, Tempul siam ṭhat nân hman tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kum sawmhnih leh pathum chhûng Joasa a lal tawh hnu pawh chuan Tempul chu siam ṭhat a la ni ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jehoiada leh puithiam dangte chu a ko va, “Engtizia nge Tempul in la siam ṭhat loh? Tûn aṭang chuan in pawisa dawn chu kawl tawh suh u, in dah khâwm ngei tûr a ni; tichuan, Tempul chu siam ṭhat a ni thei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puithiamte chuan pawisa kawl loh chu an remti a, Tempul tlabal la siam rih loh pawh ṭha an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Puithiam lalber Jehoiada chuan bâwm a siam a, a chhîn a tiâwng a; maichâm bulah, Tempul luh dâwn ding lamah a dah a. Tempul luhna bula puithiam an dah chuan Pathian hnêna petute thilpêk an rawn ken chu an lo dawng a, bâwmah chuan an thlâk zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bâwma tangka a awm tam deuh veleh lal lehkhaziaktu leh puithiam Jehoiada chu an lo kal a, tangka chu an rawh tui a, a bûk zât an chhinchhiah zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A zât chiah an chhinchhiah hnu chuan Tempul siam ṭhat hna enkawltute kutah an pe a, anni chuan hnathawktu mistirite hlawh an pe ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lungchher mite leh lungla mite chuan Tempul siam ṭhatna tûr thingte leh lungte an lei a, pawisa hman ṭûlna apiangah pawisa an pe chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thawhlâwm pawisa chu tangkaraw no te, berhbu te, tawtawrâwt te, khâwnvâr enkawlna hmanrua te, tangkarua leh rangkachaka thil hrang hrang siam nân chuan an hmang hauh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hnathawktute hlawhah leh hmanraw lei nân chauh hman a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hnathawktute chu an rinawm êm êm a, an pawisa hman dân pawh enpui a ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sual thawina leh bawhchhiat man thilhlan ruala an rawn pêkte erawh chu dah tel ve a ni lo, puithiamho chan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutih hun lai chuan Suria lal Hazaela chuan Gath khua a bei a, a la a. Jerusalem beih zêl a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Juda lal Joasa chuan a hmaa lal Jehosafata te, Jehorama te leh Ahazia ten Lalpa tâna an thilpêk dah khâwmte chu a la a, amah ngeiin a pêk pawh chu a belhchhah a; Tempul leh lal in sum bâwma rangkachak zawng zawng chu a vaiin lal Hazaela chu thilpêk atân a pe a, a sipaite chu Jerusalem ata a hruai kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal Joasa thil tih dang zawng zawng chu Juda lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joasa chu a hote pahnihin an phiar a, Beth-milo an tih Silo chhuknaah an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A thattute chu Simeata fapa Jozakara leh Somera fapa Jehozabada an ni. A thi a, Davida khawpuiah lal thlânah an phûm a. A fapa Amazia chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahazia fapa Joasa chu Judai rama kum sawmhnih leh pathum a lal kumin Jehua fapa Jehoahaza chu Israel ramah a lal ṭan a, Samaria khuaah kum sâwm leh pahnih a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal Jeroboama, Nebata fapa ang bawkin Lalpa laka thil sual a ti a. Israel-te a hruai sual a, a thil ṭha lo tihte chu a sim duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, Israel-te chungah Lalpa chu a thinur a, Suria lal Hazaela leh a fapa Ben-hadada chuan Israel chu an hneh leh ṭhin a phal a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehoahaza chu Lalpa hnênah a ṭawngṭai a, Suria lalin Israel-te a tihhrehawmzia a hmuhin a ṭawngṭaina chu a rawn chhâng leh ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel-te hnênah chhantu a tîr ṭhîn a. Suria-ho lakah chuan a chhan chhuak a, tûn hma angin thlamuang takin an awm leh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nebata fapa Lal Jeroboama chhûngten Israel-te an hruai khawlohna sual kha an la sim chuang lo va, an ti lui zêl a, Aseri lim chu Samaria khuaah chuan a la awm ta reng tho mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jehoahaza chuan sipai tihtham a nei tawh lo, sakawr chungchuang mi sawmnga, tawlailîr sâwm leh kea kal sipai sîngkhat chauh a nei a ni. Suria lalin a thahsak zo va, kea vaivut chîl ang maiin a chîl darhsak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoahaza thil tih dang zawng zawng, a huaisenzia te chu Israel lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thi a, a fapa Joasa chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judai rama Joasa kum sawmthum leh pasarih a lal kumin Joasa chu Israel ramah a lal ṭan a. Samaria khuaah kum sâwm leh paruk a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani pawhin Lalpa hmuha thil sual, Israel lal Nebata fapa Jeroboaman Israel-te a hruai khawlohna sual kha a bân bîk lo, a ti lui ve zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Joasa thil tih dang, Juda lal Amazia nên an indova a huaisenzia thute chu Israel lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Joasa chu a thi a, Samaria khuaah lal thlânah an phûm a. A fapa Jeroboama pahnihna chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zâwlnei Elisa chu a thihpui tûr natna tuarin a mu a, a thih dâwn hnaih chuan lal Joasa chuan a va tlawh a; “Ka pa, ka pa, Israel-te chhantu ropui,” tiin a ṭah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Elisa chuan a hnênah, “Thalngul leh thal ṭhenkhat han la teh,” a ti a. Thalngul leh thal ṭhenkhat chu a rawn la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel lal hnênah chuan, “Thalngul kha chelh teh,” a ti a, a chelh hnu chuan Elisa chuan lal kut chungah a kut a nghat a, “Khawchhak lam tukverh kha hawng teh,” a ti a, a han hawng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Thal kha kâp teh,” a ti a. A han kâp a, zâwlnei Elisa chuan, “Suria hnehna tûr Lalpa thal i ni e, Suria-ho nên Afek-ah in inbei ang a, a hnehtu zâwk i ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Elisa chuan lal hnênah, “Thal dang kha la leh teh,” a ti a, a han lâk chuan, “Lei kha chhun teh,” a ti a, vawi thum a han chhun a, a bâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian mi chu a thinur a, “Vawi nga vawi ruk chhun la, Suria-ho chu an ral dêr thlengin i hneh tûr, vawi thum chauh in hneh dâwn a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Elisa chu a thi a, an phûm ta a. Kum a lo thar apiangin Moab-hovin Israel ram an rawn rûn ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi pakhat hi a thi a, an phûm dâwn laiin Moab rual khat lo kal an hmu a, Elisa thlânah chuan an vawm lût rawk a, an tlân ta a. Chu mi ruang chuan Elisa ruh a deh veleh a lo nung leh a, a ding thei ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jehoahaza dam chhûng chu Suria lal Hazaela chuan Israel-te chu a tirethei hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mahse, Lalpa chuan a khawngaih a, an chhiat ṭhak a phal lo va, Abrahama te, Isaka te leh Jakoba te hnêna a thuthlung avângin a lainat a, a ngaihsak leh ṭhîn, tûn thlengin a la thlauhthla lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Suria lal Hazaela chu a thi a, a fapa Ben-hadada chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jehoahaza fapa Joasa chuan Hazaela fapa Ben-hadada kut ata, a pa Jehoahaza khua an lâksakte chu a la kîr leh a, an indonaah vawi thum a hneh a, Israel ram khuate chu a chhuhsak leh ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehoahaza fapa Joasa chu Israel lal a nih kum hnih kumin Joasa fapa Amazia chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kum sawmhnih leh pangaa upa a nihin Judai ram lal a ni ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmhnih leh pakua a lal a. A nu chu Jerusalem khaw mi Jehoadini a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa hmuha thil ṭha a ti a, a pu lal Davida erawh chu a tluk lo, a pa Joasa tih ang a ti ve zêl mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hnam dang pathian an biakna hmunsângte chu a tichhe lo, mipuite chuan chûngah chuan thilhlan an hlân a, rimtuite an la hâl ta cheu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amazia chuan, a lal ngheh veleh, a pa thattute chu a that ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An fate erawh chu a that lo; Mosia Dân bu-a Lalpa thupêk, ‘Fate chu an pate sual avânga tihhlum tûr an ni lo, pate pawh an fate sual avânga tihhlum tûr an ni lo; mi tin mahni sual avâng chauhva thi tûr an ni,’ a tih kha a zâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amazia chuan ‘Chi ruamah’ Edom mi singkhat a that a, Sela khua a bei a, a la a, a hmingah Joktheel a vuah a, tûn thlengin hmingah a la pu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amazia chuan Jehoahaza fapa Joasa, Israel lal hnênah palai a tîr a, “Ti teh, pa leh pa i han inhmachhawn teh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel lal Joasa chuan Juda lal Amazia chu thu a thawn a, “Lebanon tlânga sidar thing hnênah Lebanon tlâng lênhlîng chuan, ‘I fanu ka fapa nupuiah min neihtîr rawh,’ a ti a. Ramsa tei mai mai hian lênhlîng chu a pal thlu ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Edom-ho ka zu hneh e’ i ti a, i inchhuang ta vei hle a ni maw: lungawi takin inah tawm hle hle tawh mai rawh. Nang leh Judai ram chhiatna tûr buaina chawk chhuak teh suh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amazia chuan a pawisa lo va, Israel lal Joasa chu a thawk chhuak a, Juda lal Amazia nên chuan Judai ram chhûng Beth-semes khuaah chuan ‘pa leh pa an inhmachhawn’ ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Juda-ho chan chu a chau ta zâwk a, mahni in lamah an tlân haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel lal Joasa chuan Juda lal Amazia chu Beth-semes-ah chuan a man a. Jerusalem-ah a chho va, kulh bang, Efraim kawngkhâr aṭanga kulh Kawina kawngkhâr thlengin, tawng zali zet chu a tichhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa Tempul chhûng leh lal sum in aṭanga tangka leh rangkachak leh bungbêl awm zawng zawng chu a la a, a sal mante nên chuan Samaria khuaah a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Joasa thil tih dang, a ropuizia te, Juda lal Amazia nêna an indo thu te Israel-te lal chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joasa chu a thi a, Samaria khuaa lalho thlânah an phûm a. A fapa Jeroboama pahnihna chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel lal Jehoahaza fapa Joasa thih hnuin Amazia chu kum sâwm leh panga a dam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amazia thil tih dangte chu Juda lal chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem-ah Amazia chu an phiar a, Lakis khuaah a tlân a; mahse, a hmêlmate chuan an ûm a, an that ta tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ruang chu Jerusalem-ah sakawrin an phur haw a; Davida khawpuiah, lal thlânah an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Judai ram mite chuan a fapa kum sâwm leh paruka upa Uzia chu a pa Amazia aiah lalah an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A pa thih hnu chuan Uzia chuan Elath khua chu Judai ramah a la kîr a, a din ṭha leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joasa fapa Amazia chu Juda lal kum sâwm leh panga a nih kumin Joasa fapa Jeroboama pahnihna chu Israel lal a ni ṭan a, Samaria khuaah kum sawmli leh pakhat a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa hmuha thil sual chu a ti a, an pu Nebata fapa Jeroboama thil sual tih, Israel-te a hruai khawlohna sual chu a bân chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel ram ni ṭhîn, Hamath kalkhân aṭanga Tuipui Thi inkâr ramte chu a la kîr a. Chu chu, a chhiahhlawh Gathhefer mi, Amitaia fapa zâwlnei kâa Lalpa , Israel-te Pathianin a sawi kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel-te tuar hrehawmzia chu Lalpa chuan a hmu a, naupang pawh puitling pawh, tu mah tuar lo an awm lo va, ṭanpuitu rêng rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel-te chu tihchhiat hlen dêr zawng a tum lo, chhantu atân Jeroboama pahnihna hi a rawn hmang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jeroboama thil tih dang zawng zawng, indonaa a huaizia te, Damaska leh Hamath kalkhân Israel rama a lâk kîr thu te, Israel lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jeroboama chu a thi a, Samaria khuaa lalho thlânah chuan an phûm a, a fapa Zekaria chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeroboama pahnihna chu Israel rama kum sawmhnih leh pasarih a lal kumin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amazia fapa Uzia chu kum sâwm leh paruk a ni a, Juda lalah a ṭang ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmnga leh pahnih a lal a. A nu chu Jerusalem mi Jekoli a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pa Amazia angin Lalpa hmuha thil ṭha a ti ṭhîn a. Hnam dang pathian biakna hmunsângte erawh chu a tibo lo va, chûngah chuan miten thil an la hlânin rimtui an la hâl cheu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuvângin, lal chu Lalpa chuan a rawn khawih a, a dam chhûngin a phâr ta a, in hrangah a inkhung ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A fapa Jothama chuan lal chhûngkua chu a ho va, Judai ram chu a awpsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Uzia thiltih dangte chu Juda lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Uzia chu a thi a, Davida khawpuia lal thlânah an phûm ve a, a fapa Jothama chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Uzia chu Judai rama kum sawmthum leh pariat a lal kumin Jeroboama fapa Zekaria chu Israel ramah a lal ṭan a. Samaria khuaah thla ruk a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hmaa lal dangte ang bawkin Lalpa hmuha thil sual chu a ti ve a, Nebata fapa Jeroboama thil sual tih, Israel-te a hruai khawlohna sual kha a bân chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jabesa fapa Saluma chuan Zekaria chu a phiar a, Ibleam-ah a that a, a aiah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zekaria thil tih dangte chu Israel lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jehua hnêna Lalpa thu sawi, “I thlah chhuan li thlengin Israel lal in ni ang,” a tih ang kha a ni ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Uzia chu Juda lal kum sawmthum leh pakua a nih kumin Jabesa fapa Saluma chu Israel lal a ni ṭan a. Samaria khuaah thla khat a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gadia fapa Menahema chu Tirza aṭangin Samaria khuaah a lo kal a. Saluma chu a that a, a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saluma thil tih dang zawng zawng chu Israel-te lal chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tirza aṭanga Menahema a lo kal khân Tapua khua chu a hnêna an inpêk duh loh avângin a tichhe vek a, a chhûnga chêngte leh a vêl rama mite chu a that a, hmeichhe rai laite pawh an dul a pîrthlêrsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Uzia chu Juda lal kum sawmthum leh pakua a nih kumin Gadia fapa Menahema chu Israel ramah lal a ni ṭan a, Samaria khuaah kum sâwm a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa hmuha thil sual a ti a, Nebata fapa Jeroboama thil sual tih, Israel-te a hruai khawlohna sual kha a dam chhûng chuan a thlah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal Tiglat Pilesera chuan Israel ram a rawn rûn a, Menahema chuan tangkarua kg. sîngthum leh sângli a lo pe a, Israel rama nghet lehzuala lala ṭhu tûrin a puih duh a beisei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Menahema chuan Israel mi hausate tangka tlang sawmnga zêl a lâksak a, chu chu a pe a ni. Tichuan, Tiglat Pilesera chu an ram lamah a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Menahema thiltih dang zawng zawng chu Israel lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A thi a, an phûm a, a fapa Pekahia chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Uzia chu Juda lal kum sawmnga a nih kumin Menahema fapa Pekahia chu Israel ramah lal a ni ṭan a, Samaria khuaah kum hnih a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa hmuha thil sual a ti a, Nebata fapa Jeroboama thil sual tih, Israel-te a hruai khawlohna sual kha a thlah chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A sipai hotu pakhat Remalia fapa Peka chuan Gilead khaw mi sawmnga nên an phiar a, Pekahia chu Samaria khaw kulhbîng Argob leh Aria bulah an that a, a aiah a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pekahia thil tih zawng zawng chu Israel lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Uzia chu Juda lal kum sawmnga leh pahnih a nih kumin Remalia fapa Peka chu Israel ramah lal a ni ṭan a, Samaria khuaah kum sawmhnih a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lalpa hmuha thil sual a ti a, Nebata fapa Jeroboama thil sual tih, Israel-te a hruai khawlohna sual kha a thlah chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Peka lal lai hian Asuria lal Tiglat Pilesera chuan Ijon te, Abel-beth-maaka te, Janoa te, Kades te leh Hazor khua te chu a la a, Gilead ram te, Galili ram te, Naftali ram te a la bawk a, mite chu Asuria ramah salah a hâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Uzia fapa Jothama chu Judai lal kum sawmhnih a nih kumin Ela fapa Hosea chuan Peka chu a phiar ru a, a bei a, a that a; a aiah a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Peka thil tih dangte chu Israel lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Remalia fapa Peka chu Israel lal kum hnih a nih kumin Uzia fapa Jothama chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />kum sawmhnih leh panga a ni a, Juda lal a ni ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh paruk a lal a, a nu chu Zadoka fanu Jerusi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A pa Uzia tih angin Lalpa hmuha thil ṭha a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hnam dang pathian biakna hmunsângte erawh chu a tiral lo; miten thil an hlân a, rimtui an hâl ta cheu a ni. Tempul hmâr lam kawngkhâr hi Jothama siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jothama thil tih dangte chu Juda lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A lal lai hian Lalpa chuan Suria lal Rezina leh Israel lal Peka chu Judai ram bei tûrin a rawn tîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jothama chu a thi a, Davida khawpui lalho thlânah an phûm a, a fapa Ahaza chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Remalia fapa Peka chu Israel lal kum sâwm leh pasarih a nih kumin Jothama fapa Ahaza chu
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kum sawmhnih a nihin Judai ramah a lal ṭan a. Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh paruk a lal a. A pu Davida angin Lalpa hmuha thil ṭha a ti ve lo; Lalpa lâwm loh zâwng a ti thung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel lalho tih dân ṭha lo a zâwm ve a ni. Ama fapa ngei pakhat pawh hâlral thilhlan atân a talh a, milem hmaah a hlân a; Israel-te hmaa Lalpa hnawh chhuah hnam danghote thiltih tenawm tak tak tih an chînte kha tih a chîng ve ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tlâng tinrênga hnam dang pathian biakna hmunsângah te, thingbuk ṭha hlim apiangah te thilhlante a hlân a, rimtuite a hâl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Suria lal Rezina leh Israel lal Peka chuan Jerusalem an bei a; mahse, an la thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hetih lai hian Suria lal Rezina chuan Elath khua a la leh a, Juda-ho va awmte chu a hnawt chhuak a, Edom-ho chu Elath khuaah chuan tûn thlengin an awm ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahaza chuan Asuria lal Tiglat Pilesera hnênah palai a tîr a, “I chhiahhlawh, i fa ka nih hi, Suria lal leh Israel lalin min bei a, an kut ata min rawn chhan chhuak ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahaza chuan Lalpa Tempul leh lal sum dahna in ata tangka leh rangkachak awm chu Asuria lal biak tlawn nân a thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asuria lal chuan Ahaza ngen angin Damaska khua chu a sipaite nên a bei a, a la a, Rezina chu a that a, mite chu a khawpui Kir-ah salah a hâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asuria lal Tiglat Pilesera hmu tûrin Ahaza chu Damaska khuaah a kal a, Damaska khuaa maichâm chu a en a, puithiam Uria a ko va, maichâm an siam dân hmang chu chipchiar takin a entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Uria chuan Damaska khuaa mi ang chiah maichâm a siam a, Ahaza lo kîr hmain a siam zo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Damaska khua aṭanga a lo hâwn chuan Ahaza chuan maichâm siam zawh tawh chu a rawn hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal chuan hâlral thilhlan te, buhbâl thilhlan te a hlân a, uain thilhlan te a bun a, remna thilhlan thisen te chu maichâmah chuan a theh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dâr maichâm, Lalpa hnêna hlan tawh chu maichâm thar leh Tempul inkâra awm a ni a, a la sawn a, maichâm thar hmâr lamah a dah sawn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Uria hnênah, “Ka maichâm hi a lian zâwk a, zîng hâlral thilhlan leh tlai hâlral thilhlan hâl nân hmang la, lal leh mipui puala hâlral leh buhbâl thilhlante pawh hâl ṭhîn la, mipui uain thilhlante chu bun ṭhîn ang che. Hâl ral atân leh thil dang atâna ran hlan thisen chu he maichâmah hian theh ang che. Dâr maichâm erawh chu Pathian ka rawn biak nân khêk tlat ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Uria chuan lal thu ang chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lal Ahaza chuan dâr nawrlirh chu a phelh darh a, tui bâwm chu a la thla a. Dâr tuizêm, bâwngpa sâwm leh pahnih chunga inhûng pawh kha a sawn a, lungrem chungah a hûng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Asuria lal tlawn lungawi nân Ahaza chuan Tempul aṭangin lalṭhutthlêng hûnna tûr dawhkân pawh chu a la sawn a, Tempula lal luhna tûr bîka siam kawngka pawh a hnawh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal Ahaza thiltih dang zawng zawng chu Juda lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahaza chu a thi a, Davida khawpuia lal thlânah an phûm a, a fapa Hezekia chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahaza chu Juda lal kum sâwm leh pahnih a nih kumin Ela fapa Hosea chu Israel lal a lo ni a, Samaria khuaah kum kua a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa hmuha thil sual a ti a, a hmaa Israel lalte ang êm erawh chu a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asuria lal Salmanesera chuan a rawn bei a, Hosea chu a lo inpe a, kum tin chhiah a chawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kum khat chu Hosea chuan Aigupta lal Soa hnênah palai a tîr a, ṭanpuiah a sâwm a; kum tin chhiah Asuria hnêna a pêk kha a pe duh ta lo va. Salmaneseran chu chu a hriatin Hosea chu a man a, tân inah a khung ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Salmanesera chuan Israel ram chu a rûn ta a, Samaria khua chu a hual a. An hual kum thumna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hosea kum kua a lal kumah Samaria khua chu Asuria lal chuan a la ta a; Israel-te chu salah a man a, Asuria ramah a hruai a. Ṭhenkhat chu Hala khuaah te a awmtîr a, ṭhenkhat chu Gozan bial Habor lui kamah te, Media ram khuaah te a awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel-ten an Pathian, Lalpa laka thil sual an tih avângin Samaria khua chu a chhe ta a ni. Aigupta lal kut ata a chhan chhuak a, Aigupta ram aṭang chuan a hruai chhuak a; mahse, Pathian dang an biaksan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />hnam dang, an hmaa a hnawh chhuahte awm dân kha an la a, Israel lalten thil ṭha lo tak an chîn chhuahte chu an chîng ve ta zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An Pathian remtih loh zâwng Israel-te chuan an ti a; an khaw tê ber leh lian berah pawh hnam dang pathian biakna hmunsâng an siam zêl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mual tinah mai, thingbuk ṭha deuh hlim apiangah lung milem leh pathiannu Aseri lem thing an phun thliah thluah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ram ata Lalpa hnawh chhuahte tih dân ṭhin angin hnam dang maichâmahte chuan rimtui an hâl a. An thil sual tihte chuan Lalpa chu an tithinur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa thupêk, milem biak loh tûr a tih chu an awih duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel-te leh Juda-te chu hrilh tûrin a tirhkoh leh zâwlneite a tîr ṭhîn a, “In khawsak dân tenawm tak hi bânsan ula, in thlahtute hnêna ka dân pêk ziakna bu-a chuang ka chhiahhlawh zâwlneite sawi, ka thupêkte leh ka thuruatte kha zâwm zâwk rawh u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mahse, an awih duh tlat lo, an pute angin luhlul an chhuah a, an Pathian, Lalpa chu an ring duh mawlh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thuruatte chu an hnâwl a, an pate nêna a thuthlung chu an bawhchhia a, a zilhna pakhat mah an bengkhawn duh lo. An ho êm a, milem ho tak takte an be mai mai a, Lalpa chuan, ‘an awm dân la suh u’ a tih, an vêla hnam dangte awm dân chu an la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa , an Pathian thupêk zawng zawng an hnâwl a, dârin bâwngno lem pahnih an chhûng a, chibai an bûk a. Pathiannu Aseri limte an siam a, arsite chibai an bûk a, Baal rawng an bâwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An fanu an fapate chu hnam dang pathian hnêna hâlral thilhlanah an hlân a, ramhuaizâwl leh mitthi thlûk thiamte an râwn a. Lalpa hmuha thil ṭha lo tinrêng ti tûrin an inpumpêk a ni; chuvângin, an tithinur ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel mite chungah Lalpa chu a thinur a, a hmuh phâk lohvah a hnawt bo va, Juda-ho chauh an la awm ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Juda-ho pawh chuan an Pathian, Lalpa thupêkte chu an zâwm chuang bîk lo, Israel-te tih dân kha an la ve zêl zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel zawng zawngte chu a hnâwl ta a, a hrem a, hmêlma râwng pui pui kutah a pe a, a hmuh phâk loh tûrah a tîr bo ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel-te kha Juda-ho laka a tihhran hnu khân Nebata fapa Jeroboama chu an lalah an siam a. Lalpa bânsan tûrin Israel-te chu a ti a, sual râpthlâk tak a tihtîr a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jeroboama hnung chu an zui a, thil sual a tih ang apiang chu an ti ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A chhiahhlawh zâwlneite hmanga a sawi ang khân a hmuh phâk loh tûrah a hnawt bo ta nge nge a ni. Tichuan, Israel mite chu Asuria ramah tûn thlengin salah an la tang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asuria lal chuan Babulon te, Kutha te, Iva te, Hamath te leh Sefarvaim khuaa awm te chu a hruai a, Israel sala hruai tâkte aiah Samaria ramah chuan a awmtîr a; chûnga khuate chu an luah a, an chêng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An lo awm tirh chuan Lalpa biak nachâng an hre lo va; sakeibakneite a tîr a, a seh ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Asuria lal chu, Samaria ram khuaa a mi dahte chuan chu ram pathian dân chu an hre lo va; chuvângin, chu pathian chuan seh tûrin sakeibakneite a tîr a ni tih an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Sala kan man puithiam pakhat kha chhuah ula, an ram pathian dân zirtîra, an zînga awm ve tûrin kîrtîr teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel puithiam pakhat Samaria khua aṭanga sala an man chu a kal a, Bethel-ah a lo awm a; chuta ṭang chuan mite chu Lalpa biak dân tûr a zirtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Samaria rama awm tate chuan anmahni milem an siam ta zêl a. Israel-hovin Pathian biakna hmun tûr an siamah chuan an dah a, pâwl hrang hrang khân mahni awmna khuaah milem an siam ṭheuh zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Babulon aṭanga lo kalte chuan Sukot-benot lim an siam a, Kutha mite chuan Nergala lim an siam a, Hamath-ho chuan Asima lim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Iva mite chuan Nibhaza lim, leh Tartaka lim te, Sefarvaim-ho te chuan an pathian Andramelek leh Anamelek lim hmaah an fanu leh an fapate hâlral thilhlan atân an hlân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hêng mite hian Lalpa chu an be ve tak a, an zînga mi tu pawh puithiamah an ṭantîr a, hnam dang pathian biakna hmunsângah te puithiam hna an thawhtîr a, an thilhlante an lo hlansak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lalpa chu an bia a, an lo kalna ram tih dân angin anmahni pathiante chu an be tho va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Vawiin thlengin an tih dân hlui chu an la chîng a ni. Lalpa chu an be tak tak lo, a dân leh a thupêk, Jakoba thlah, Israel tih tâkte hnêna a pêk chu an zâwm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Israel mite nên Lalpa chuan thu a thlung a, “Pathian dang be suh u; chibai bûk suh ula, an rawng bâwl suh ula, an hnênah thilhlan hlân hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zo tak leh thei taka Aigupta ram aṭanga lachhuaktu che u thu hi awih rawh u, chibai min bûk ang a, thilhlante ka hmaah in hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />In tâna ka ziak, dânte leh thupêkte hi in zâwm fo tûr a ni, pathian dangte thu in awih tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Thuthlung ka siamsak che u hi in theihnghilh tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kei in Lalpa , in Pathian thu hi in awih tûr a ni; tichuan, in hmêlmate lakah ka chhan chhuak ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, chûng mite chuan an bengkhawn lo, an tih ṭhin chu an ti zêl mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hêng mite hian Lalpa chu chibai zawng an bûk na a, an milemte chu an be tho mai, an thlahte pawhin tûn thlengin chutiang chuan an la ti zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ela fapa Hosea chu Israel lal kum thum a nih kumin Ahaza fapa Hezekia chu
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kum sawmhnih leh pangaa upa a nihin Juda lal a ni ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmhnih leh pakua a lal a. A nu chu Zekaria fanu Abijai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pu Davida angin Lalpa hmuha thil ṭha a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hnam dang pathian biakna hmunsângte a tichhia a, lungphunte a tibung a, pathiannu Aseri lim thing phunte chu a kit a. Mosia dâr rûl siam Nehustan an tih chu a chhu chhia a. Chumi hun thleng chuan Israel-ten dâr rûl lem tân rimtui an hâl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hezekia chuan Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chu a ring a, Juda lal, amah ang hi an awm ngai lo, an awm leh tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chu a vuan tlat a, a thu a hnial ngai lo. Mosia hnêna Pathian thupêk kha ngun takin a zâwm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan a awmpui a, a thiltih apiangah a hmuingîl zêl a ni. Asuria lakah a hel a, a thu a awih duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Filistia mite a sawisa ṭhîn, an awmna apiang a rûn a; khaw tê ber pawh, khaw lian ber pawh Gaza leh a chhehvêl ramte pawh a hrût ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hezekia kum li a lal kum chuan Hosea chu Israel lal kum sarih a ni hman tawh a, Asuria lal Salmanesera chuan Israel ram a rawn rûn a; Samaria khua chu a hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An hual kum thum kum, Hezekia lal kum ruk kum chuan an la ta a, chu chu Hosea lal kum kuana a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asuria lal chuan Israel-te chu salah a man a, Asuria ramah a hruai a, a ṭhen erawh chu Gozan bial Habor lui kamah te, Media khuaah te a awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel-ten an Pathian Lalpa thu an awih loh avângin Samaria khua chu an la a ni, thuthlung a siamte kha an bawhchhia a, Lalpa chhiahhlawh Mosia dân pakhat mah an zâwm duh hek lo. An ngaithla duh lo va, an pawm duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hezekia kum sâwm leh pali a lal kumin Asuria lal Senakeriba chuan Judai rama kulh nei khuate chu a bei a, a la ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lakis khuaa Senakeriba awm chu Hezekia chuan, “Thil ka lo tidik lo a ni; min kîrsan la, i phût ang ang ka pe ang che,” tiin thu a thawn a. Asuria lal chuan tangkarua kg. sîngkhat leh rangkachak kg. sângkhat a lo phût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tempul leh lal sum bâwma tangka awm zawng zawng chu a thawn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tempul kawngkhâra rangkachak belte chu a khawk a, amah ngeiin kawngka biang a tuamna rangkachak pawh chu a khawk a, Senakeriba chu a thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asuria lal chuan Lakis aṭangin Jerusalem-a Hezekia chu bei tûrin sipai tam tak a tîr a, a sipai hotu lian lian pathum-Tartana te, Rab-Saria te leh Rab-Sakea te chuan an ho va. Jerusalem an han thlen chuan dîl chhakta zâwk aṭanga tuikawng kam, puansutu hmun panna kawngah chuan an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lal chu an au va, lal in enkawltu Hilkia fapa Eliakima te, lehkhaziaktu Sibna te, Asafa fapa, thil chhinchhiahtu Joa te chu an lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rab-Sakea chuan an hnênah, “Hezekia hi han hrilh rawh u, lal ropui Asuria lal chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Tu nge maw rinchhan i neiha, heti taka i inchhutngên le!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hmui themthiam ringawtin sipai chakna leh indo thiamna i ngam thei dâwn em ni? Asuria lal laka i hel vei hi tu nge rawn pui dâwn che?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aigupta-in a rawn pui ang che maw? Luang tiang hawl ang lek a ni asin, a tliak ang a, i kut a chhun mai ang. Aigupta lal Farawa chu amah rinchhantute tân chutiang lek chu a ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“In Pathian Lalpa chu kan rinchhan a ni in ti elo? Juda mite leh Jerusalem mite chu ‘Jerusalem-ah chauh Lalpa chu biak tûr a ni’ in ti vei a, hmun danga Lalpa maichâm leh a biakna hmun tichhetu kha Hezekia hi a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, ka pu, Asuria lal nên inremsiam mai rawh u; a chuang tûr mihring i hmuh zawh dâwn phei chuan sakawr sânghnih ka pe nghâl mai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asuria sipai hotu neu ber pawh in tluk si lo va, sakawr-tawlailîr te, sakawr chungchuang te Aigupta chuan a rawn thawn tehlul ang che maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />In ram ka rawn bei a, ka rawn la hi Lalpa thu a ni lâwm ni? Amah Lalpa ngei chuan, ‘Han bei la, la vek rawh,’ min ti a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Eliakima te, Sebna te leh Joa te chuan, “Suria ṭawngin thu sawi rawh, kan hre thei e; Juda ṭawng chu hmang suh, kulh banga ṭhute hian an ngaithla ṭhup a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Asuria lal hian nangni leh in lal Hezekia hnênah chauh thu sawi tûrin mi tîr em ni? Ni suh e; mipui, tûna kulh banga ṭhu, nangmahni ang bawka mahni zun leh êk eia in tûrte hnênah pawh thu ka sawi a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, Rab-Sakea chu a ding a, Juda ṭawngin a au va, “Lal ropui Asuria thu hi ngaithla teh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />‘Hezekia chuan bum che u suh se, ka lakah a hum thei chuang lo vang che u,’ lal chuan a ti e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />‘ Lalpa chuan min chhan dâwn alâwm, Asuria lal chuan he khua hi a la lo vang’ tiin Lalpa ring tûrin bum che u suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hezekia thu ngaichâng duh suh u, Asuria lal chuan, ‘Inremsiam ang u, lo chhuak ula, ka lo kal leh hma chu mahni grep rah in ei ang a, mahni theipui rah in tlân ang a, mahni tuizêm tui in in ṭheuh dâwn nia,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lal chuan in ram anga ram ṭhaah, grep huan ṭha tak tak, uain tamna ramah a la awmtîr ang che u a, chhangphut tûr buh ṭhat duhna ram, oliv kûng te, a hriak te, khawizu tamna ramah chuan a awmtîr ang che u. A thu in awih chuan nungdamin in chhuak ang, in thi lo vang. ‘ Lalpa chuan min chhan chhuak ngei dâwn e,’ tiin Hezekia chuan bum che u suh se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hnam dang pathiante zingah Asuria lal laka chhanhim thei an awm em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hamath leh Arpad pathiante kha khaw nge an awm tâk? Sefarvaim pathian te, Hena leh Iva pathiante kha khaw nge an awm tâk? Samaria khua chhan thei an awm em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hêng ram zawng zawng pathiante hian engtikah khân nge an ram chu an chhan ngai? Lalpa pawhin Jerusalem khua hi a chhan thei bîk dâwn em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lalin, “Tu man chhâng suh u,” a tih avângin an ngawi ṭhuap a, kam khat mahin an chhâng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lal chhûngkaw enkawltu Hilkia fapa Eliakima te, ziaktu Sebna te, thil chhinchhiahtu Asafa fapa Joa te chuan an puan an pawtthlêr a, an lo kal a, Rab-Sakea thu chu Hezekia an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Hezekia chuan chûng thu chu a hriatin a puan a pawtthlêr a, saiip puan a sin a, Lalpa Tempulah a lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal chhûngkaw enkawltu Eliakima te, ziaktu Sebna te leh puithiam zînga upate chu saiip puan sinin zâwlnei Isaia hnênah a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Lal Hezekia chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Vawiin hian kan tân manganna ni a lo thleng ta; min hmuhsit a, min diriam tâk êm hi! Nau hrin hun tawh a nu chau lutuk tawh si ang mai kan nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian nung sâwt tûra Asuria lal mi tirh, Rab-Sakea thu sawi kha, Lalpa , i Pathian chuan a lo hre châwk ang a; Lalpa , i Pathian chuan hriain hrem teh se. Kan mi la dam chhunte tân nang ṭawngṭai rawh khai,’ a ti e,” an va ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal Hezekia mi tirhte chu Isaia hnên an va thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Isaia chuan an hnênah, “ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Asuria lal chhiahhlawhten min diriam dân thu i hriat kha hlau suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai teh, a rilru ka tizâm ang a, thuthang ka hriattîr ang; a ramah a kîr ang a, a ram ngeiah khandaihin an sât hlum ang,’ tiin in pu hnênah sawi rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rab-Sakea chu a ṭîn a, Lakis aṭangin Asuria lal chu a insawn a, Libna khua a bei tih a hriatin chu lam chu a pan a, a va hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ethiopia lal Tirhaka chanchin Asuria lal chu an hrilh a; amah bei tûrin a lo thawk tih a hriatin Hezekia hnênah zualko a tîr a, lehkha a thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judai ram lal Hezekia hnênah, “I rinchhan in Pathian chuan, ‘Asuria lal kutah Jerusalem chu a pe lo vang,’ tiin bum che u suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asuria lalten an ram luah dang zawng zawnga an thiltih, an ram an tihchhiat vek dânte i hria a. Nang tehlul hi i him bîk dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Ka paten an tihchhiat hnam Gozan te, Haran te, Rezep te leh Telasar-a awm Edom-ho te kha an pathianten an chhan thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khawiah nge Hamath lal te, Arpad lal te, Sefarvaim-a khaw awm lal te, Hena lal te, Iva lal te kha an awm tâk?’ va ti rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zualko lehkha rawn ken chu Hezekia chuan a hmuhin a han chhiar a, Lalpa Tempulah a chho va, Lalpa hmaah chuan a pharh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hezekia chu Lalpa hnênah a ṭawngṭai a, “Aw Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, Cherub chunga ṭhu, nang chauh hi Pathian chu i ni, ram luah zawng zawng rorêltu i ni a, lei leh vân pawh hi i siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i beng lo chhi la, ngaithla teh. Aw Lalpa , meng la, han en teh; Pathian nung sâwt tûra Senakeriban thu a rawn sawi zawng zawng hi ngaithla teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , Asuria lalte hian hnam tin an bei a, an ramte an tihchhiat tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An pathiante chu meiah an rawhsak a, chu chu Pathian an ni lo rêng a, mihring kuta siam thing leh lung mai mai an ni a, chhe ngei tûr phei zawng an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , tûnah a kut aṭang hian min chhan chhuak la; tichuan, khawvêl ram luah zawng zawnga miten nang chauh hi Pathian, Lalpa chu i ni tih an hre dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amoza fapa Isaia chuan Hezekia hnênah mi a tîr a: “A hnêna i ṭawngṭaina chungchâng leh Asuria lal Senakeriba chungchânga
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa thu sawi chu hei hi a ni: ‘Zion fanuin a hmusit che a, a nuihzat che. Jerusalem fanuin I tlânchhia chu lu a thinkhum che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu nge i nuihzata, i sâwt le? Tu lakah nge i râwl i rin? Tu lakah nge i hawi chapo hle le? Israel Mi Thianghlima lakah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I chhiahhlawhte hmangin Lalpa i sâwt vei a, ‘Tawlailîr tam tak nên tlâng sâng sângah ka lâwn a, Lebanon tlâng kil tin ka fang; Sidar thing sâng ka kit a, Fâr thing ṭha ṭha ka kit asin. A tlâng sâng lai ngaw rilte pawh ka fang vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuite ka chhun chhuak a, ka in bawk a, Aigupta luite ka kephahin ka dai kang vek a ni,’ i ti vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hmân aṭanga tih ka tum tawh a ni, I hre na nge? Tûna thil lo thleng hi hmâna ka rêl daih tawh a ni. Kulh nei khuate i tihchhiata,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A chhûnga chêng an zâmzia te leh thlabâr taka an mualpho te, Phûl leh muala hlobet, In chung zâwla hnim ṭiak tîr te, Thli lum chhêm vuai tâk te, Ka rêl lâwk vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka chunga i ânhla te, I ṭhut, i luh leh chhuahte ka hria asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka chungah hian i âng vei a, I chapozia ka beng a lo thleng ta, I hnârah chuan hnâr kawl ka vuah ang a, Lakam ka barh ang che a, I lo kalna lamah ka hnûk kîr leh ang che,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lal Hezekia hnênah, “Hei hi i tân chhinchhiahna a ni ang. Kuminah buh hli in ring ang a, nakkumah pawh chumi hli chu in ring leh ang. A kum thumnaah chuan thlai chîng ula, a rah in seng dâwn nia. Grep phun ula, a rah in ei bawk ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Judai rama la dam chhunte chu theikûng, thûk taka zung thlâk, rah tup ang hi an la ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jerusalem aṭangin dam chhuak tûr an awm a, Zion tlângah thi bâng an awm ngei dâwn a ni. Lalpa ṭhahnemngaihna chuan chu chu a ti ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chuvângin, Asuria lal chungchâng chu Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘He khawpuiah hian a lût lo vang a, thal khat pawh a thlah lo vang, phaw nên a rawn bei lo vang a, lei kulh a lai hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A lo kalna kawngah ngei a haw leh ang, khuaah a lo lût tawp lo vang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />He khua hi keimah avâng leh ka chhiahhlawh Davida avângin ka vêng ang a, ka hum dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chumi zân chuan Lalpa tirhkoh chu Asuria-ho bûkah chuan a kal a, mi nuaikhat leh sîngriat leh sangnga a that a, zînga an han thawh chuan mitthi ruang hlîr a lo thal phung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Asuria lal Senakeriba chu a ṭîn a, a haw a, Ninevi khuaah a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nisroka tempula a pathian biaa a kûn lai chu a fa Andrameleka leh Sarezera te chuan khandaihin an sât hlum a, Ararat ramah an tlân ta a. A fapa Esarhadona chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan lal Hezekia chu thih ngamin a na a. Amoza fapa Isaian a rawn tlawh a, a hnênah, “ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘I chhûngkaw thu rêl fel rawh, i thi dâwn si a, i dam chhuak dâwn lo ve,’ a ti,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hezekia chuan bang lam a hawi a, a ṭawngṭai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Aw Lalpa , i hmaah dik takin ka awm ṭhîn a, thinlung thianghlim puin i mit hmuha thil ṭha ka tih ṭhin kha khawngaih takin hre reng ang che,” a ti a, a ṭap ta zawih zawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Isaia chu a haw a, lal in tual chu a pelh hmain Lalpa mite chunga rorêltu Hezekia hnênah chuan Lalpa chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a tîr kîr a, “‘Kei Lalpa , i pu Davida Pathian hian i ṭawngṭaina ka lo hria a, i mittui pawh ka hmu. Ka tidam ang che, a ni thum ni chuan Tempulah i kal thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kum sâwm leh pangain i dam chhûng hun ka pawtsei bawk ang. Asuria lal lakah nang leh he khua hi keimah avâng leh ka chhiahhlawh Davida avângin ka humhim dâwn a ni, a ti,’ va ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Isaia chuan, “Theipui rah hmin hlâwm han la teh u,” a ti a. Theipui rah hlâwm chu a khawihliah chuan an belsak a, a lo dam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal Hezekia chuan, “ Lalpa chuan min tidam ang a, ni thum ni chuan Tempulah ka kal thei ang tih engtin nge ka hriat ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Isaian, “ Lalpa chuan a tidam dâwn che tih hriatna tûr chhinchhiahna a entîr ang che. I rahkaa hlim saw, rahka sâwm kîr nge i duh rahka sâwm kal belh se, i duh zâwk thlang rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hezekia chuan, “Rahka sâwm kaltîr chu a awl em mai, rahka sâwm kîr rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Isaia chu a ṭawngṭai a, lal Ahaza rahka siama hlim chu Lalpa chuan rahka sâwm a tikîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Babulon lal Baladana fapa Merodak-baladana chuan Hezekia chu a dam leh tih a hriatin thilpêk leh lehkha a rawn thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hezekia chuan anni chu a lo lâwm hle a, a sum dahna in te a entîr a, a tangkarua leh a rangkachak te, a mosola leh a thil rimtui te, a râlthuam dahkhâwmna in leh a ram chhûng hmun hrang hranga a ro dahte chu entîr loh rêng rêng a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zâwlnei Isaia chu Hezekia hnênah a lo kal a, “Hêng mite hi khawi aṭanga lo kal nge an niha, eng nge an rawn sawi?” a ti a. Hezekia chuan, “Ram hla tak, Babulon aṭanga lo kal an nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Isaia chuan, “Lal ina thil eng eng nge an hmuh?” a ti a. Lal chuan, “Engkim an hmu vek, thil dahnaa kan dah entîr loh rêng ka nei lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lal hnênah Isaia chuan, “ Lalpa thu hi ngaithla teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Ngai teh, i ina thil awm zawng zawng, i paten vawiin thlenga an dah khâwmte nên, Babulon-a an lâk vek hun a lo thleng lawk dâwn, eng mah hnutchhiah an nei lo vang,’ Lalpa chuan a ti e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangma hrin ngei, i fapate chu an man ang a, an til an rehsak ang a, Babulon lal rawng an bâwl ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal Hezekia chuan a dam chhûng chu muang takin an awm ang a, an him dâwn tihna niin a ngai a, “ Lalpa thu i rawn thlen chu a ṭha alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lal Hezekia thil tih dang zawng zawng, a huaizia te, tui khuapin tui kawng a kera khuaa tui a lâk luh thu te, Juda lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hezekia chu a thi a, a fapa Manasea chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sâwm leh pahnih a nihin Manasea chu Juda lalah a ṭang ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum sawmnga leh panga a lal a. A nu chu Hefzibi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A mite hmaa Lalpa hnawh chhuah hnamte tih dân tenawm tak tak chu Manasea chuan a ti ve a, Lalpa lakah thil sual a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pa Hezekia tihchhiat, hnam dang pathian biakna hmunsângte chu a din ṭha leh a, Baal tân maichâm a siam a, Israel lal Ahaba ang khân Aseri limte a phun a, vâna arsite pawh a bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Jerusalem khua hi min biakna hmun tûr chu a ni,’ tiin Lalpa chuan a hmun hi a thlang a; chuta Lalpa Tempulah chuan maichâm chi tinrêng a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tempul chhûng pindan pahnihah chuan vâna arsi rual tân te maichâm a dah thluah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A fapa pakhat chu hâlral thilhlanah a hlân a. Aien te, ṭhumvâwrte a chîng a, ramhuaizâwl leh mitthi thlûk thiamte a ruai ṭhîn. Lalpa hmuha thil sual nasa tak a ti a, a tithinur a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Davida leh a fapa Solomona hnênah Lalpa chuan, ‘He Jerusalem khuaa Tempul hmun hi Israel hnam sâwm leh pahnih ram zawng zawng zîngah min biakna hmun tûra ka thlan a ni,’ a tih, Tempul chhûngah khân Aseri lim thing a phun a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Israel mite chuan ka thupêk zawng zawng an awiha, ka dân, Mosia hrilh kha an zawm vek chuan an thlahte hi ram ka pêk ata chu ka hnawt chhuak lo vang,’ a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judai rama mite chuan Lalpa thu chu an awih lo va, an hmaa Lalpa hnawh chhuah hnamte tih ṭhin aia sual zâwk ti tûrin Manasea chuan a hruai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a chhiahhlawh a zâwlneite hmangin hetiang hian a sawi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Manasea chuan thil tenawm tak tak, he rama an awm hmaa awm Kanan mite tih aia tenawm zâwk a ti ṭhîn, a milem siam chawpin Juda-te chu a hruai sual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, Kei, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian hian, a hria apiangin mak an tih êm êm tûr Jerusalem leh Judai ramah chhiatna ka thlentîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samaria khua leh Israel lal Ahaba leh a thlahte ka sawisa ang khân Jerusalem pawh ka sawisa ang. Thlêng hrûk fai an khup ang hian Jerusalem pawh a chhûnga awmte chu ka hru fai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka mi, la thi bângte pawh chu ka hnâwl ang a, an hmêlmate kutah ka pe ang a, chûng chuan an duh duhin an rawk ang a, an sawisa ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An thlahtute Aigupta ram aṭanga an lo chhuah aṭang tawh khân tûn thlengin, ‘hei chu thil sual a ni’ ka tih chu an ti ṭhîn a, min tihthinur avângin chutiang chuan ka mite chu ka sawisa dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Manasea chuan pawi khawih lo a that tam khawp a, Jerusalem khaw laiah thisen a luang zuih ṭhîn; Juda mipuite chu milem biak a chîntîr a, Lalpa lakah thil sual an tih phah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Manasea thil tih dang, thil sual a tihte chu Juda lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Manasea chu a thi a, lal huan, lal Uzia huanah an phûm a, a fapa Amona chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amona chu kum sawmhnih leh pahniha upa a nihin Juda lalah a ṭang ṭan a, Jerusalem-ah kum hnih a lal a. A nu chu Jotba khaw mi Haruza fanu Mesulemeti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pa Manasea angin Lalpa hmuha thil sual a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A pa tih dân a la a, a pa biak ṭhîn milemte kha a be ve zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An thlahtute Pathian, Lalpa chu a hnâwl a, Lalpa thupêkte chu a awih duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A hote zînga miin an phiar ru a, lal in chhûngah an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Juda-ho chuan Amona fapa Josia chu lalah an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amona thil tih dangte chu Juda lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amona chu Uzia huana thlânah chuan an phûm a, a fapa Josia chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josia chu kum riat a nihin Juda lal a ni ṭan a, Jerusalemah kum sawmthum leh pakhat a lal a. A nu chu Bozkat khaw mi Adaia fanu Jedidi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Josia chuan Lalpa lawmzâwng a ti a, a pu lal Davida awm dân a la a, Pathian dânte chu uluk takin a zâwm thlap ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kum sâwm leh pariat a lal kumin Josia chuan ziaktu Safana, Azalia fapa, Mesulama tupa chu Lalpa Tempulah a tîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Puithiam lalber Hilkia hnênah kal la, Tempul kawngkhâra mipui thawhlâwm puithiamhovin an dawn kha eng zât nge tling tawh va zâwt teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tempul siam ṭha tûra mi ruatte kutah pe sela, anni chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />mistiri te, in satu te leh lung chher mi te pe rawh se; Tempul siam ṭhatna tûr thing te, lung te lei teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hêng kan mi ruatte hi mi rinawm tak tak an ni, en zuipui an ngai lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puithiam lalber Hilkia chuan ziaktu Safana hnênah, “Tempulah dân bu ka chhar e, hei,” a ti a, a pe a. Safana chuan a han chhiar a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal hnênah a lo kîr leh a, “I chhiahhlawhte chuan in chhûnga tangka an hmuhte chu an phawrh a, Lalpa Tempul siam ṭha tûra mi ruatte kutah an pe tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal hnênah chuan, “Puithiam Hilkia chuan hei lehkhabu hi mi lo pe asin,” a ti a, lal hriat tûr chuan Safana chuan a chhiar ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalin Dân lehkhabua thu chu a han hriat chuan a puan a pawtthlêr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puithiam Hilkia te, Safana fapa Ahikama te, Mikaia fapa Akbora te, ziaktu Safana te, lal in enkawltu Asaia te hnênah lal chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Kal ta ula, mipui leh Judai ram mi zawng zawng tân he Dân bu chhara zirtîrna chungchâng hi Lalpa min va râwnsak teh u. Kan pute chuan heta thu chuangte hi an ngaihsak lo va, tih tûrte hi an tih loh avângin Lalpa chu a thinur a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Puithiam Hilkia te, Ahikama te, Akbora te, Safana te, Asaia te chu zâwlneinu, Mika fapa Saluma nupui Huldaii hnênah an kal a. A pasal Saluma hi Tikva fapa a ni, lal thawmhnaw enkawltu a ni a, Harhasa tupa a ni, Jerusalem vêng thara awm an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, “Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa chuan, ‘A rawn tîrtu che u chu hrilh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Juda lalin a chhiar lehkhabua thu chuang ang khân Jerusalem leh a chhûnga chêngte chu ka sawisa dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Min hawisan a, pathian dang hnênah thilhlan an hlân a, an thiltihte chuan min tithinur a ni. Jerusalem chungah ka thinur a alh ang a, a mit mai mai lo vang,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa râwn tûra rawn tîrtu che u lal hnênah chuan sawi rawh u, Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa chuan, ‘Lehkhabua thu chuang chu i ngaihven a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem leh a chhûnga chêngte ka sawisak dân tûr i hriatin pawi i ti a, Lalpa hmaah i inphahhniam a, puan pawtthlêrin i ṭap a. Hmuh râpthlâk khawp leh ânchhia inlawhna hiala hman tûrin khawpui chu ka sawisa dâwn a ni; mahse, i ṭawngṭaina chu ka lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I thih hma chuan Jerusalem chu ka tichhe lo vang; nang zawng thlamuang takin i thi ang,’ a ti e,” a ti a. Chu thu chu lal hnênah an rawn thlen leh a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal chuan Judai ram leh Jerusalem-a upate chu a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judai ram leh Jerusalem-a awm puithiam leh zâwlnei te, mipui, mi rethei leh hausate nên, an za chuan tempulah an lo kal a, Tempula an chhar Thuthlung bu chu an hriatah lal chuan a chhiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dinna tûra an siamah chuan lal chu a ding a, Lalpa hnung zuia a thupêkte zâwma, a thuruatte leh a thupêkte chu ti tûrin Lalpa hmaah thu a tiam a. Rilru tak tak leh tihtakzetin thuthlung thu lehkhabua chuangte chu pawm tlat a tiam a. Mipui zawng zawng pawh chuan dingin thuthlung chu pawm an tiam ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lal chuan puithiam lalber Hilkia te, a dawttu puithiamte leh kawngkhâr vêngtute chu Lalpa Tempul chhûnga Baal te, Aseri te leh vân arsi an biakna thil hman zawng zawng chu a lâk chhuahtîr a, Jerusalem dai Kidron luiruamah chuan a hâl a, a vâp chu Bethel-ah a kentîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judai khawpuiah te, Jerusalem kiang vêla hnam dang pathian biakna hmunsânga thil hlântu atâna Juda lalten puithiam an lo dah, Baal hnênah te, ni leh thla hnênah te, arsi leh vâna thil awm hnênah te thil hlân ṭhîntu zawng zawng chu a bân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa Tempul chhûnga pathiannu Aseri lim an phunte chu a la chhuak a, Jerusalem daiah Kidron ruamah chuan a hâl a, a vâp chu a râwt sawm a, vântlâng thlânmualah chuan a theh darh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tempula nawhchizuarho awmna, Aseri biakna tûr, nu hovin puan an tahna hmun chu a ṭhiat bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judai ram khawpui hrang hranga Geba leh Beer-seba inkâra awm puithiamte chu a hruai khâwm a, hnam dang pathian hnêna thil an hlanna ṭhin hmunsângte chu a tihbawlhhlawhsak a. Khawpui luhna kawngkhâr vei lam, khawpui awptu Josua siam kawngkhâr bula maichâm, kêlhuai lim an biaknate chu a ṭhiat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chûnga puithiama ṭang ṭhînte chu Tempula rawng an bâwl an phal lo, an puithiamte puala dah chhang dawidim telh loh erawh chu an ei ve thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Moleka hnênah hâlral thilhlana pêk atân an fanu te, an fapa te an hlan tawh loh nân Hinom ruama Tofet chu a sawisa nek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Juda lalten ni hnêna hlan tûr sakawr an pêkte chu Tempul tual kawngka bul, sawrkâr milian tak Nathan-meleka chênna in aṭanga hnai têah an dah ṭhîn, chûng chu a dah bo va, ni pathian an hnuh ṭhinna tawlailîrte chu a hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lal inahte leh Ahaza in chung chhâwng zâwla an maichâm te, Tempul pindan pahnihna Manasean maichâm a siam belhte nên chuan a ṭhiat a, a chhu chhe vek a, Kidron ruamah a paih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem khawchhak lam Oliv tlâng chhim lama Sidon pathian tenawm Astarte lim te, Moab pathian tenawm Khemosa te, Amon-ho pathian ngeiawm tak Milkoma lim an biakna tûr hmunsâng, Israel lal Solomona siamte kha a tibawlhhlawh zo vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Josia chuan lungphunte chu a chhu sawm a, pathiannu Aseri lim, an thingtum phunte chu a kit a; chûng awmna hmunah chuan mihring ruh a dah phung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel hruai khawlotu Nebata fapa Jeroboaman Bethel khuaa pathian biakna tûra maichâm a siamte pawh Josia chuan a ṭhiat a, a lungte chu a tikeh a, a chhu dip vek a. Aseri limte pawh chu a hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Josia chu a han hawi vêl a, mualah chuan thlân a hmu a, a phawrh a, mihring ruhte chu maichâmah chuan a hâl a, a tibawrhbâng ta a. Chutiang a nih tûr thu chu tûn hma, kût an hman ṭuma lal Jeroboaman maichâma thil a hlan laia zâwlneiin a hrilh lâwk kha. Josian a han en vêl chuan chu thu lo hrilh lâwktu
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />zâwlnei thlân chu a hmu a. “Tu thlân nge?” a ti a. Bethel khaw mite chuan, “Judai ram aṭanga lo kal zâwlnei, hêng i thil tih tâk lo sawi lâwktu thlân a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Josia chuan, “Khawih ve suh u, a ruhte chu awm mai mai teh se,” a ti a. Tichuan, tu man a ruhte chu an khawih lo, Samaria khua aṭanga lo kal zâwlnei ruh pawh an khawih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel ram khaw tinah Israel lalhovin hnam dang pathian biakna hmunsâng an lo siamte chu a tichhia a, chûng lalte chuan Lalpa chu an tithinur a ni. Bethel khuaa a tih ang khân an hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chûnga rawngbâwltu puithiamte chu a that a, maichâmah chuan mihring ruhte a hâl a, Jerusalem-ah a lo kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuthlung bu-a ziak angin an Pathian, Lalpa chawimawi nân mipuite chu Kalhlên kût hmang tûrin lal Josia chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hemi ṭuma mi ang rêngin Israel lal pawh, Juda lal pawh, Kalhlên kût hmang ropui, rorêltuten ro an rêl lai ata tu mah an la awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutiangin Josia lal kum sâwm leh pariat kum chuan Jerusalem-ah Kalhlên kût an hmang ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Puithiam lalber Hilkian Tempula Dân bu a chhara chuang Dânte chu an zawm theih nân Josia chuan Jerusalem khua leh Judai ram ata chu aienthiam te, mitthi thlûk chîngte a hnawt chhuak a, chhûngkaw pathian an biak te, milem te leh hnam dangin pathian an biak te pawh chu a paihtîr vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rilru leh tihtakzetin theihtâwp chhuaha Lalpa rawngbâwl leh Mosia dâna mi ang zâwm hi tûn hmain tu mah lal an la awm ngai lo, tûn hnuah pawh an awm tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lal Manasea thiltihte avâng khân Juda-ho chungah Lalpa thin a ur a, tûn thleng pawhin a thinur a la dai lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Israel-te chunga ka tih ang kha Juda-ho chungah pawh ka ti ve ang, Juda-ho chu ka hmuh phâk loh tûrah ka hnawt chhuak ang. Ka hmun thlan, Jerusalem chu ka hnâwl ang a, min biak ṭhinna tûra ka ruat Tempul chu ka chhuahsan bawk ang,” a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Josia thil tih dangte chu Juda lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Josia lal lai hian Aigupta lal Nekoa chuan a sipaite Eufretis luiah Asuria lal ṭanpui tûrin a hruai a. Lal Josia hian lo dan a tum a. Megido-a an inbeihnaah a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A hote chuan a ruang chu tawlailîrah an dah a, an hâwn a, lal thlânah an phûm ta a. Juda-ho chuan Josia fapa Jehoahaza lalah an thlang a, hriak an thih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jehoahaza chu kum sawmhnih leh pathum a nihin Juda lal a lo ni a, Jerusalem-ah thla thum a lal a. A nu chu Libna khaw mi Jeremia fanu Hamutali a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A pute ang bawkin Lalpa hmuha thil sual a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aigupta lal Nekoan Hamath bial Ribla hmunah salah a man a, a lal a tâwp ta a. Aigupta lal chuan Juda-te chu tangkarua kg. sângnga leh rangkachak kg. sawmnga a chawitîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lal Nekoa chuan Josia fapa pakhat Eliakima chu a pa aiawh tûrin lalah a dah a, a hming a thlâksak a, Jehoiakima a vuah a. Jehoahaza chu Aigupta ramah a hruai a, a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lal Jehoiakima chuan Aigupta lalin chhiah a phût pe tûrin mipui hnênah, an hausak leh hausak loh athuin a khawn ve thung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jehoiakima chu kum sawmhnih leh panga a nihin Juda lal a lo ni a; Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh pakhat a lal a. A nu chu Ruma khaw mi Pedaia fanu Zebidi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A pute ang bawkin Jehoiakima chuan Lalpa hmuha thil sual a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehoiakima a lal lai hian Babulon lal Nebukadnezara chuan Judai ram a rûn a, a hnuaiah Jehoiakima chu kum thum chhûng a lal a, a hel ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Babulon sipai rual te, Moab te, Amon sipai rual te chu Jehoiakima beia, Judai ram tichhe tûrin a tîr a. Hetianga a tih tûr thu hi Lalpa chuan a zâwlneite hmangin a lo sawi lâwk tawh rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lal Manasea thil sual tih te, pawi khawih lo a thah ṭeuh avângte khân hmuh phâk lohva Juda-ho a hnawh chhuah daih theih nân chûng thil chu Lalpa thupêka lo thleng a ni; Lalpa chuan Manasea thil tih hi a ngaidam thei ngang lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jehoiakima thil tih dang zawng zawngte chu Juda lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jehoiakima chu a thi a, a fapa Jehoiakina chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eufretis lui leh Aigupta hmâr lam ramri inkâr zawng zawng hi Babulon lal thuhnuaia a awm tâk avângin, Aigupta lal leh a sipaite chu an lo thawk chhuak leh tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoiakina chu kum sâwm leh pariat a nihin Juda lal a lo ni a, Jerusalem-ah thla thum a lal a. A nu chu Jerusalem mi Elnathana fanu Nehusti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A pa ang bawkin Jehoiakina chuan Lalpa hmuha thil sual a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A lal lai hian lal Nebukadnezara sipaite chuan Jerusalem an rawn hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An hual lai chuan lal Nebukadnezara chu Jerusalem-ah a lo kal ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nu te, a fa te, a sipai te leh lal ina milian te nên Jehoiakina chu Babulon lal kutah a inpe a. Nebukadnezara chuan a lal kum riat kum chuan Jehoiakina chu salah a man a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tempul leh lal ina sum awm zawng zawng nên Babulon khuaah a hâwn a, Lalpa sawi lâwk angin lal Solomonan Tempula hman tûr rangkachak bungbêl a siam zawng zawng chu a tichhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lal Nebukadnezara chuan Jerusalem khaw mi, lal chhûngkua zawng zawng, milian zawng zawng, mi sîngkhat salah a hruai a. Mi themthiam rual, thîrdêngte pawh a hruai vek a, Judai ramah chuan mi mâwl tê tê chauh a hnutchhiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nebukadnezara chuan Jehoiakina chu a nu te, a nupui te, a milian te leh Judai rama milian deuh deuh te nên Babulon-ah salah a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nebukadnezara chuan sipaia ṭang tlâk zawng zawng chu Babulon-ah a hruai vek a ni; mi sângsarih leh mi themthiam rual, thîrdêng te nên sângkhat zet nên a hruai a ni. Chûng chu sipaia ṭang tlâk vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nebukadnezara chuan Jehoiakina pa nau Matania chu Juda lalah a dah a, a hming a thlâksak a, Zedekia a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zedekia chu Kum sawmhnih leh pakhat a nihin Juda lal a lo ni a, Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh pakhat a lal a. A nu chu Libna khaw mi Jeremia fanu Hamutali a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lal Jehoiakina angin Lalpa mit hmuha thil sual Zedekia chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chu Jerusalem leh Judai ram mite chungah a thinur êm a, a hmuh phâk lohvah a hnawt chhuak ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zedekia chu Babulon lal lakah a hel a. Tichuan, Zedekia kum kua a lal kum, thla sâwmna, ni sâwm niin Nebukadnezara chu a sipaite nên an lo kal a, Jerusalem chu an rawn bei a, khaw daiah chuan bûk an khuar a, bang an theu hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zedekia lal kum sâwm leh pakhatna thlengin an hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chumi kum, a thla lina, ni kua ni chuan khuaah ṭâm a nasa ta hle a, mite chuan ei tûr an nei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khaw kulh chu an tiâwng ta a. Babulon-ho chuan an hual tlat nâ a, a chhûnga sipai zawng zawng chu lal hovin zânah an chhuak ru vek a. Lal huan bulah an kal a, kulh bang pahnih inkâr kawngkhârah an chhuak a, Jordan lui lamah an tlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Babulon sipaite chuan lal Zedekia chu an ûm a, Jeriko bul phaiah an man a, a sipaite chuan an tlânsan ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zedekia chu Ribla khuaa Nebukadnezara hnênah an hruai a, a chungah ro a lo rêl nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hmuh lai ngeiin a fate chu Nebukadnezara chuan a thahsak a, Zedekia mitmu pawh a kherchhuahsak bawk a; kawl a buntîr a, Babulon-ah a hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babulon lal Nebukadnezara lal kum sâwm leh pakuana thla nga, ni sarih ni chuan Nebukadnezara vêngtu pâwl hotu Nebuzaradana chu Jerusalem khuaah a lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tempul chu a hâl a, lal inte leh Jerusalem-a milianho zawng zawng inte pawh a hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A sipaite chuan khaw kulh bang chu an ṭhiat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nebuzaradana chuan khawpuia mi la awmte chu Babulon-ah a hruai a, mi themthiam, Babulon-a la kal ve lote pawh salah a hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi berh tê tê chauh grep huante leh lote thlo atân Judai ramah chuan a hnutchhiah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kaldai-ho chuan Tempul dâr ban te, tawlailîrte leh dâr tuizêm te chu an chhuchhia a, a dâr tlangin Babulon-ah an hâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maichâma vutlawh leh vut dahna te, khâwnvâr chhitna hmanrua te, thilhlan thisen lo dawhna no te, rimtui hâlna bûr te, Tempul rawngbâwlnaa thil hman dâr chi rêng rêng chu an la vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rangkachak leh tangkaruaa thil siam rêng rêng chu, berhbu tê tak tê tê, meilawh chenin an la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Solomonan Tempul atân dâra a siam ban te, tawlailîr te, tuizêm te chu bûk hleih theih loh khawpa rit a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ban pahnihte chu an inang chiah a, tawng sâwm leh pariata sâng an ni ve ve bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sipai hotu ber Nebuzaradana chuan puithiam lalber Seraia te, a dawttu puithiam Zefania te leh Tempula hotu lian pathumte pawh Babulon-ah a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuaa hotu la awm te, sipai hotu dawttu sipai lam chanchin vawng ṭhatu te leh mi dang, mi pawimawh, mi sawmruk te chu
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nebuzaradana chuan Hamath bial Libna khua, Nebukadnezara awmna khuaah chuan a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lal chuan a vua a, a lo tihlum hlawm a. Chutiang chuan an ram aṭangin sala hruai an ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Babulon lal Nebukadnezara chuan Ahikama fapa Gedalia, Safana tupa chu Judai ram awptuah a ruat a, Babulon-a hruai ve lohte kha a kutah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Juda sipai leh an hotu Babulon lal hnêna inpe ve duh loten an hriatin Mizpa khuaa Gedalia hnênah an kal a; chûng sipaite chu Nethania fapa Ismaela te, Karea fapa Johanana te, Netofa khaw mi Tanhumeta fapa Seraia te, Maaka khaw mi Jazania te, an mite nên an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gedalia chuan an hnênah leh an mite hnênah chuan, “Kaldai sawrkâr hnathawkho hi hlau suh u. Ramah hian awm ve mai ula, Babulon lal hnuaiah kûn ula in tân a ṭha ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chumi kum, a thla sarihnaah Nethania fapa Ismaela, Elisama tupa, lal thlah zînga mi chu mi sâwm nên Mizpa khuaah a kal a, Gedalia chu a bei a, a that ta mai a. A bula awm Israel leh Babulon mite pawh chu a that bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel mi zawng zawng, rethei tak takte leh sipai hotu ni ṭhînte chu Babulon-ho an hlauh avângin Aigupta ramah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Evil-merodaka, Babulon lal a nih kumin, Judai lal Jehoiakina chu a khawngaih a, tân in ata a chhuah a, Jehoiakina chu kum sawmthum leh pasarihna, thla sâwm leh pahnihna, ni sawmhnih leh pasarih a tân hnu chuan a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A be ṭha hle a, lalṭhutthlêng chu a tânpui lal dang lalṭhutthlêng aiin a tihsânsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A tân in kawrte chu a hlîp a, a dam chhûng chuan lal bulah chaw a kîl ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A dam chhûng chu a mamawh tûr ni tin bithliah neiin an pe ṭhîn a.
  </para>
</usx>
